RADAR_LOAD("2025-06",[{"id":"10.3390/nitrogen6030052","t":"Multi-Class Machine Learning to Quantify the Impact of Nitrogen Management Practices on Grassland Biomass","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/nitrogen6030052","s":"Nitrogen","d":"2025-06-30","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Grassland biomass yield reflects a complex interaction of management intensity and environmental factors, yet quantifying the relative role of practices such as mowing and fertilization remains challenging. In this study, we introduce a multi-class machine learning framework to predict above-ground biomass on 150 permanent grassland plots across eight years (2009–2016) in Germany’s Biodiversity Exploratories and to evaluate the influence of key management variables. Following rigorous data cleaning, imputation of missing nitrogen values, feature standardization, and encoding of categorical practices, we trained CatBoost classifiers optimized via Bayesian hyperparameter search and mitigated class imbalance with ADASYN oversampling. We assessed model performance under binary, three-class, four-class, and five-class quantile-based categorizations, achieving test accuracies of 0.76, 0.57, 0.","au":["Sebastian Raubitzek","Margarita Hartlieb","Philip König","Judith Hinderling","Kevin Mallinger"],"o":"回填","zt":"多类机器学习量化氮管理实践对草地生物量的影响","zb":"草地生物量产量反映了管理强度和环境因素的复杂相互作用，但量化如割草和施肥等实践的相对作用仍然具有挑战性。本研究引入了一个多类机器学习框架来预测德国生物多样性探索站 150 个永久草地样地 8 年（2009–2016）的地表生物量，并评估关键管理变量的影响。在严格的数据清理、缺失氮值的插补、特征标准化和分类实践的编码后，我们通过贝叶斯超参数搜索优化了 CatBoost 分类器，并使用 ADASYN 过采样减轻了类别不平衡。在二元、三分类、四分类和五分类分位数分类下评估了模型性能，分别实现了 0.76、0.57、0.42 和 0.38 的测试精度。在所有方案中，割草频率和矿物氮输入是主要的预测因子，而次要变量如排水和调理剂的使用也做出了贡献。这些结果表明，从标准化的管理记录中可以可靠地预测广泛的生物量类别，而更精细的区别则需要额外的环境信息或自动化传感来捕获非线性效应并减少报告偏差。这项工作展","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.31257/2018/jkp/2024/v16.i02.16321","t":"Synthesis of Photodetectors Based on CdS Nanostructures by SILAR Method without Using Ammonia as a Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.31257/2018/jkp/2024/v16.i02.16321","s":"Journal of Kufa-Physics","d":"2025-06-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"In this paper, photodetectors based on CdS thin films were successfully prepared and deposited on glass substrates using the SILAR method without using ammonia as a catalyst and with the presence of ammonia. The previously mentioned samples were named as Z3 and Z4, respectively. The structural, morphological, and optical properties were studied. XRD data revealed a crystal phase and a cubic structure of CdS with peaks corresponding to planes (111), (022), and (131). Also, the measured crystal size of plane (111) was 20.506 and 54.661 nm for samples Z3 and Z4 respectively. FESEM images showed homogenous nanosized grains for prepared samples. The absorption spectra and energy band gap of CdS were measured with UV-Vis spectroscopy, which showed that for sample Z3 and for sample Z4 and both were seen to be tended toward redshift. The (I-V) properties of Z3 and Z4 photodetectors revealed a we","au":["Zainab Salam","Hussein Abdullah Alshamarti"],"o":"回填","zt":"使用 SILAR 方法合成 CdS 纳米结构的探测器而不使用氨作为催化剂","zb":"使用 SILAR 方法在玻璃基板上制备 CdS 薄膜探测器，无氨催化剂和有氨催化剂分别制备 Z3 和 Z4 样品。XRD 显示 CdS 具有立方结构，(111) 晶面尺寸分别为 20.506 nm 和 54.661 nm。FESEM 显示均匀纳米晶粒。UV-Vis 光谱显示能带隙红移。Z3 和 Z4 在可见光下响应弱，紫外光下响应强。在 5V 偏置下，Z3 光电流增加，Z4 增加。Z4 光响应高于 Z3。Z3 和 Z4 上升时间分别为 3.4 和 3.21 s，衰减时间均为 3.2 s。","ob":"光驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202501867","t":"Enzyme‐Mimetic Single‐Atom Catalyst Design for Green Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202501867","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2025-06-29","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis plays a vital role in human development, and the renewable‐driven electrochemical approach offers a sustainable pathway for its green production. By drawing inspiration from and structurally mimicking natural enzymes, single‐atom catalysts (SACs) demonstrate huge potential for efficiently electrolyzing molecular nitrogen or nitrate for NH 3 synthesis. In this review, the latest advances in enzyme‐mimetic SACs for NH 3 synthesis are comprehensively summarized and highlight the significance of enzyme mimicry from four key aspects, including active sites, multi‐enzyme complexes, substrate‐binding pockets, and electron/proton transfer pathways. The fundamentals of SACs are first introduced, highlighting their unique advantages and outlining state‐of‐the‐art design strategies and modification methods for performance optimization. The structural characteristi","au":["Xiaohui Yang","Jiarui Yang","Xiaobo Zheng","Yuhai Dou","Haitao Li","Yan Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"酶模拟单原子催化剂设计用于绿色氨合成","zb":"氨 (NH3) 合成在人类发展中起着至关重要的作用，由可再生驱动的电化学方法为其绿色生产提供了一条可持续的途径。通过从自然酶中汲取灵感并模仿其结构，单原子催化剂 (SACs) 在高效电解分子氮或硝酸盐合成 NH3 方面显示出巨大潜力。在本综述中，全面总结了酶模拟 SACs 用于 NH3 合成的最新进展，并强调了酶模拟在四个关键方面的意义，包括活性位点、多酶复合物、底物结合口袋和电子/质子转移途径。首先介绍了 SACs 的基础知识，突出了它们的独特优势，并概述了用于性能优化的最新设计策略和改性方法。然后深入研究了氮酶、硝酸还原酶和亚硝酸还原酶的结构特征和催化机理，并阐明了它们对 SAC 设计的启示。最重要的是，介绍了酶模拟 SACs 中电化学氮和硝酸盐还原反应的代表实例，并讨论了多级酶模拟如何提高它们的活性、选择性和稳定性。此外，总结了酶模拟 SACs 的关键设计原则，为开发高效和耐用的 S","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1007/s00894-025-06425-5","t":"Computational investigation of electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis on Mo-doped C24N24 fullerene","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s00894-025-06425-5","s":"Journal of Molecular Modeling","d":"2025-06-28","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Context The industrial production of ammonia through the Haber-Bosch process is energy intensive and operates under extreme conditions. In contrast, the catalytic reduction of nitrogen (N₂) to ammonia (NH₃) under mild conditions presents a significant challenge with important implications for sustainable chemistry. This work investigates the potential of Mo-doped carbon nitride (C₄₂N₂₄) fullerene as a catalyst for N₂ reduction. The study reveals that Mo@C₄₂N₂₄ exhibits rapid catalytic activity, with a preference for the enzymatic mechanism for N₂ conversion to NH₃. Notably, H₂ evolution is suppressed, making Mo-doped C₄₂N₂₄ a promising candidate for ammonia synthesis under mild conditions. Methods Density functional theory (DFT) calculations were performed using the Perdew-Burke-Ernzerhof (PBE) functional within the generalized gradient approximation (GGA) framework. The DNP basis set wa","au":["Muhammad Junaid","Sajid Karam","Muhammad Iqbal","Mehran Anjum"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"对 Mo 掺杂 C24N24 球状碳氮化合物在电催化氨合成中的计算研究","zb":"研究对象为 Mo 掺杂 C24N24 球状碳氮化合物，采用密度泛函理论（DFT）计算方法，通过分析分子静电势图、Hirshfeld 电荷密度分析和自旋密度分析等手段，研究了其在氮气还原为氨气过程中的催化活性，发现 Mo@C24N24 表现出快速催化活性，并倾向于酶促机制将 N2 转化为 NH3，同时抑制了 H2 的生成，表明其在温和条件下合成氨具有潜力。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.17725/j.rensit.2025.17.305","t":"Fast Joule heating for the synthesis of graphene-containing powders from plastic waste","u":"https://doi.org/10.17725/j.rensit.2025.17.305","s":"Radioelectronics. Nanosystems. Information Technologies.","d":"2025-06-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This paper presents the results of the investigation and synthesis of graphene-containing powders from plastic waste using the fast Joule heating method. The processes were carried out on a equipment for fast Joule heating, which was developed based on a previous iteration of the prototype. Experiments were conducted on a mixture of polypropylene and carbon black, which was subjected to high-temperature treatment at various discharge voltages (100 V, 200 V, 300 V). The resulting carbon powders were analyzed using Raman spectroscopy, X-ray diffraction, and scanning electron microscopy with elemental analysis. The results demonstrated that at a discharge voltage of 300 V, turbostratic graphene with a high degree of crystallographic order was formed, as confirmed by the presence of characteristic peaks in the Raman spectra and X-ray diffraction patterns. At lower discharge voltages, graphen","au":["North-Eastern Federal University in Yakutsk","Aisen R. Prokopev","Nikolay N. Loskin","North-Eastern Federal University in Yakutsk","Dmitry N. Popov","North-Eastern Federal University in Yakutsk"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"快速焦耳加热法制备含石墨烯粉末的塑料废弃物","zb":"研究采用快速焦耳加热法从塑料废弃物中合成含石墨烯粉末。实验在基于原型迭代开发的快速焦耳加热设备上进行，对聚丙烯和炭黑混合物进行高温处理，放电电压分别为 100 V、200 V、300 V。通过拉曼光谱、X射线衍射和扫描电子显微镜及元素分析对所得碳粉末进行分析。结果表明，在 300 V 放电电压下，形成高度结晶有序的涡轮状石墨烯，拉曼光谱和 X射线衍射图谱中存在特征峰。在较低放电电压下，也形成石墨烯片，但非晶碳含量更高。所得碳粉末制备的薄膜具有低薄层电阻，有望用作超电容的导电涂层和电极。该方法有望高效将塑料废弃物转化为有价值的碳材料，应对环境挑战并促进“绿色”技术发展。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1080/1536383x.2025.2522775","t":"Novel synthesis and characterization of orange peel flash graphene by flash Joule heating process","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/1536383x.2025.2522775","s":"Fullerenes, Nanotubes and Carbon Nanostructures","d":"2025-06-27","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This work details a novel, sustainable method for orange peel flash graphene (OPFG) synthesis utilizing Iraqi orange peel-derived activated carbon (OPAC) as a precursor and flash Joule heating (FJH). OPFG characterization via SEM, TEM, EDS, XRD, Raman, FTIR, and BET analyses revealed a highly porous, turbostratic structure with a large surface area (11.168 m2/g) and an average particle size of 40.5 nm. Raman spectroscopy indicated an I_2D/I_G ratio of approximately 1.833, while XRD analysis confirmed graphitization with an interlayer spacing of 3.45 Å. FTIR spectroscopy identified surface functional groups enhancing dispersibility and reactivity. This scalable, cost-effective, and environmentally benign approach demonstrates the potential of waste biomass valorization for high-quality flash graphene production, enabling future applications in energy storage, catalysis, and environmental ","au":["Enas Sameer Alkhawaja","Hayder Mohammed Abdul-Hameed"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"快速焦耳加热法制备的橙皮闪速石墨烯的合成与表征","zb":"利用伊拉克橙皮衍生的活性碳作为前驱体，通过闪蒸焦耳热（FJH）工艺合成了橙皮闪蒸石墨烯（OPFG）。表征显示其具有大比表面积（11.168 m2/g）、平均粒径40.5 nm、层间距3.45 Å以及I2D/IG比约1.833的乱层结构。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.5c08200","t":"Bifunctional Nitrogen Reduction and Nitrate Reduction Electrocatalysis via Trimetallic RuPdPt Nanocages","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.5c08200","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2025-06-27","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic ammonia synthesis, encompassing both nitrogen reduction and nitrate reduction reactions, has been identified as a sustainable pathway for the industrial Haber-Bosch process. In this study, highly active Pd-based alloy catalysts were designed through compositional and structural control with RuPdPt nanocages successfully prepared. For nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) electrocatalysis, the yield for ammonia synthesis could achieve a high value of (153.9 ± 15.8) μg·h-1·mgcat-1 under -0.50 V vs RHE. At a potential of -0.40 V vs RHE, a Faradaic efficiency of (41.8 ± 3.4)% could be attained. For nitrate reduction reaction (NITRR), RuPdPt porous nanocages could also provide superior performance with an ammonia yield of (366.4 ± 2.7) μg·h-1·mgcat -1 at -0.55 V vs RHE with a Faradaic efficiency of (47.1 ± 4.3)% under -0.50 V vs RHE. Thus, RuPdPt nanocages are promising as an att","au":["Yijie Yang","Xiaoyun Liu","Yue Pang","Dongxu Liu","Yuqi Tang","Lujie Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过三金属 RuPdPt 纳米笼实现氮还原和硝酸盐还原的双功能电催化","zb":"研究对象为 RuPdPt 纳米笼，通过成分和结构控制制备了高活性 Pd 基合金催化剂，在氮还原反应（NRR）电催化中，氨合成产率可达 (153.9 ± 15.8) μg·h-1·mgcat-1（-0.50 V vs RHE），法拉第效率为 (41.8 ± 3.4)%（-0.40 V vs RHE）；在硝酸盐还原反应（NITRR）中，氨产率为 (366.4 ± 2.7) μg·h-1·mgcat-1（-0.55 V vs RHE），法拉第效率为 (47.1 ± 4.3)%（-0.50 V vs RHE），表明 RuPdPt 纳米笼在温和条件下具有双功能 NRR 和 NITRR 的应用潜力。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5gc01690h","t":"MOF-derived CoS x as a bifunctional electrocatalyst for efficient sulfide oxidation and coupled ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5gc01690h","s":"Green Chemistry","d":"2025-06-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"A MOF-derived CoS x catalyst enables efficient sulfide oxidation and nitrate reduction, offering an energy-saving strategy for ammonia synthesis and pollutant remediation via bifunctional electrolysis.","au":["Kwangyeol Baek","Tianlei Li","Changsoo Lee","Wenzhen Li","Kwiyong Kim"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"MOF 衍生的 CoSx 作为高效硫化物氧化和偶联氨合成的双功能电催化剂","zb":"研究对象为 MOF 衍生的 CoSx 催化剂，能够实现高效的硫化物氧化和硝酸盐还原，通过双功能电解实现节能的氨合成和污染物治理。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.inorgchem.5c02076","t":"Fe-Porphyrin MOF with Intrinsic Unsaturated Coordination Metal Sites for Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.inorgchem.5c02076","s":"Inorganic Chemistry","d":"2025-06-26","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (eNRR) is expected to overcome the limitations of high temperature, high pressure, and high energy consumption associated with ammonia synthesis in the traditional Haber-Bosch method. It is considered to be a promising approach for ammonia synthesis. In this work, a new Fe-porphyrin metal-organic framework (MOF), with porphyrin derivatives as ligands and Fe atoms as coordination metals, was synthesized as an eNRR catalyst using a simple one-step hydrothermal method. The pyridine N in the porphyrin derivative forms a coordination bond with the Fe atom coordinated inside the porphyrin ligand, resulting in a unique crystal structure that creates an unsaturated five-coordinate environment for the Fe atom. This not only increases the dispersion of Fe atoms but also enhances the adsorption capacity of the Fe atom active center for nitrogen. As a res","au":["Shaobin Li","Qingyu Cheng","Lin Ma","Li Zhang","Jianxin Wang","Kun Cheng"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"具有内在不饱和配位金属位的 Fe-卟啉 MOF 用于电催化氮还原","zb":"研究对象为 Fe-卟啉金属有机框架（MOF），通过简单的一步水热法合成，其中卟啉衍生物作为配体，Fe 原子作为配位金属，形成了独特的晶体结构，使 Fe 原子具有不饱和五配位环境，提高了 Fe 原子的分散性和对氮的吸附能力，在中性电解质和常温条件下表现出良好的催化活性，氨产率为 17.77 μg h-1 mgcat.-1（-0.2 V vs RHE）。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1080/09276440.2025.2524646","t":"Study on the synthesis process of BDC materials based on different metal centers and their ammonia adsorption performance","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/09276440.2025.2524646","s":"Composite Interfaces","d":"2025-06-26","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"With the implementation of China’s ‘dual – carbon’ strategy, hydrogen energy has emerged as the key to the development of new energy, given its green and low – carbon nature as well as abundant sources. High – efficiency ammonia storage technology plays a crucial role in the hydrogen energy industry. Due to their large specific surface area, designability, and diversity, metal – organic frameworks (MOFs) hold great potential for the adsorption and storage of ammonia (NH₃). In this study, Al3 +, Fe3 +, Co2 +, and Ni2 + metal ions, along with the organic carboxylic acid ligand terephthalic acid (H₂BDC), were used to synthesize flexible metal – organic framework materials MIL − 53 (Al3 +, Fe3 +) and transition – metal framework materials M – BDC (M = Co2 +, Ni2 +) through the solvothermal method. Their structural properties and NH₃ adsorption characteristics were systematically analyzed. Di","au":["Lei Zhang","Yidan Mu","Xueying Yang","Lei Zhang","Liu Zhang","Lizhi Chen"],"o":"回填","zt":"基于不同金属中心和其氨吸附性能的 BDC 材料合成过程研究","zb":"研究对象为基于不同金属离子（Al3+、Fe3+、Co2+、Ni2+）和有机羧酸配体对苯二甲酸（H2BDC）合成的金属有机框架（MOF）材料 MIL-53（Al3+、Fe3+）和 M-BDC（M = Co2+、Ni2+），通过溶剂热法合成，并系统分析了其结构性质和氨吸附特性，发现 Al-BDC 表现出最高的氨吸附容量（80.36 mg·g−1），表明金属中心路易斯酸性和孔结构对吸附性能有显著影响。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1039/d5re00196j","t":"Integrated electrified reactor system for efficient CO 2 -to-syngas conversion via e -methanation and e -POM","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5re00196j","s":"Reaction Chemistry & Engineering","d":"2025-06-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Image and performance of integrated electrified reactor system for efficient CO 2 -to-syngas conversion via e -methanation and e -POM.","au":["Suganuma Hiroyasu","Ryo Watanabe","Priyanka Verma","Hiroshi Akama","Choji Fukuhara"],"o":"回填","why":["electrified reactor"],"zt":"集成化电化反应器系统用于高效的 CO2 转化合成合成气","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202510139","t":"Gram‐Scale Ammonia Synthesis via Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction Using Enzyme‐Inspired Dual‐Atomic Cu Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202510139","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-06-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The potential application prospects of green electricity‐driven electrocatalytic nitrate reduction (NO₃RR) technology for the production of valuable ammonia have garnered widespread attention. However, designing electrocatalysts with remarkable activity and stability for the NO₃RR to realize gram‐level ammonia production remains a significant hurdle in terms of practical application. In nature, the synergistic effect of the dual‐site copper of nitrite reductase promotes the substrate adsorption and protonation, achieving efficient conversion of nitrite. Herein, enzyme‐inspired Cu dual‐atomic sites are constructed on polymeric carbon nitride (PCN‐Cu‐DAC). Systematic investigations indicate the dual‐atomic Cu sites in the catalyst exhibit stronger proton transfer and synergistic nitrate adsorption interaction, thereby reducing the energy barrier for *NO protonation. Studies have s","au":["Qingshuo Li","Yahui Li","Bincheng Xu","Jianping Yang","Ying Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"利用酶启发式双原子 Cu 催化剂进行电化学硝酸盐还原制备克级氨气","zb":"在聚碳氮化物上构建了酶启发式双原子 Cu 位点，利用 DFT 表征发现其具有更强的质子转移和协同硝酸盐吸附作用。该催化剂在 6 A 电流下连续运行 360 小时，实现了 11 g d−1 的氨气产率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3390/ma18133019","t":"Carbon-Based Catalysts for Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia: Design Strategies and Mechanistic Insights","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/ma18133019","s":"Materials","d":"2025-06-25","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of nitrate to ammonia offers a promising solution for both alleviating nitrate pollution in wastewater and providing a sustainable ammonia source for agriculture use. This review focuses on the role of carbon-based catalysts in electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia, emphasizing their potential in addressing environmental pollution and supporting sustainable ammonia production. Carbon materials, known for their abundance, affordability, and eco-friendly properties, are central to this process. The review highlights key strategies for enhancing catalytic performance, including heteroatom doping, the development of porous structures, and the integration of metal/metal oxide nanoparticles. Additionally, it addresses significant challenges such as weak nitrate adsorption, slow reaction kinetics, and competition with the hydrogen evolution reaction. Through","au":["Qunyu Chen","Liuyang Deng","Jinrui Zhang","Ying Zhang","Lei Zhang","Shun Lu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于电化学硝酸盐还原制氨的碳基催化剂：设计策略与机理洞察","zb":"综述了碳基材料在电化学硝酸盐还原制氨中的作用，重点讨论了杂原子掺杂、多孔结构开发及金属/金属氧化物纳米颗粒集成等关键策略。文章分析了弱硝酸盐吸附、反应动力学慢及析氢反应竞争等挑战。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/coatings15070755","t":"A Theoretical Study on Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction at Boron-Doped Monolayer/Bilayer Black Phosphorene Edges","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/coatings15070755","s":"Coatings","d":"2025-06-25","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The catalytic activity of monolayer and bilayer boron-doped edge black phosphorene nanoribbons (BPNRs) as electrocatalysts for the nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) was investigated using first-principles calculations based on density functional theory (DFT). The results indicate that boron incorporation facilitates effective N2 adsorption at specific BPNR edges, thereby achieving superior NRR electrocatalytic performance. Through NRR screening criteria, six candidate edges (B@ZZ3-1, B@ZZ4-1, B@AC0-1, B@ZZ0AA-1, B@ZZ1AB-3, and B@ZZ4AA-3) were identified. Electronic property analysis revealed that boron doping significantly reduces the bandgap of BPNRs and enhances catalytic activity by promoting electron accumulation at boron sites. Free energy pathway calculations demonstrated that B@AC0-1, B@ZZ0AA-1, and B@ZZ1AB-3 exhibit overpotentials of 0.19 V, 0.28 V, and 0.15 V, respectively, duri","au":["Wenkai Bao","Jianling Xiong","Ziwei Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"关于硼掺杂单层/双层黑磷烯边缘电催化氮还原反应的理论研究","zb":"基于 DFT 研究了硼掺杂黑磷烯纳米带边缘的电催化氮还原性能，发现硼掺杂促进了 N2 吸附。筛选出的 B@AC0-1、B@ZZ0AA-1 和 B@ZZ1AB-3 边缘在 NRR 过程中的过电位分别为 0.19 V、0.28 V 和 0.15 V。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1063/5.0271233","t":"Rational design of dual-atom δ5-borophene catalysts for nitrogen reduction reaction via density functional theory and machine learning","u":"https://doi.org/10.1063/5.0271233","s":"The Journal of Chemical Physics","d":"2025-06-25","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) for synthesizing ammonia (NH3) is a promising strategy for sustainable NH3 production. Identifying appropriate NRR electrocatalysts is crucial for enhancing the efficiency and selectivity. Here, we employed density functional theory (DFT) and machine learning (ML) to investigate the performance of dual-atom catalysts (DACs) supported on δ5-borophene (δ5-BP) for NRR. Through four-step screening process and full reaction pathway calculations, we evaluated 23 homonuclear catalysts (MM@δ5-BP) and 21 stable heteronuclear candidates (MM∗@δ5-BP). The TiTi@δ5-BP and ZrZr@δ5-BP exhibited superior NRR catalytic activity with a limiting potential (UL) of −0.60 V among MM@δ5-BP, while NbHf@δ5-BP showed the lowest UL (−0.48 V) in MM∗@δ5-BP. We also investigated the influence of applied potential on the NRR through grand canonical DFT calculations. By","au":["Dewei Zhang","Shengluo Ma","Yunwen Wu","Wei Li","Shenghong Ju"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesizing ammonia"],"zt":"基于密度泛函理论和机器学习理性设计用于氮还原反应的双原子 δ5-硼烯催化剂","zb":"利用 DFT 和机器学习筛选了 23 种同核和 21 种异核双原子催化剂，发现 TiTi@δ5-BP 和 ZrZr@δ5-BP 的极限电位为 −0.60 V，NbHf@δ5-BP 最低为 −0.48 V。通过 XGBoost 和 GBR 算法预测的极限电位与 DFT 计算结果吻合良好。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adsu.202500441","t":"Laser‐Induced HKUST‐1 Derived Porous Electrocatalyst: an Innovative Approach to Boost Sustainable Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adsu.202500441","s":"Advanced Sustainable Systems","d":"2025-06-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Conventional synthesis methods of metal‐embedded graphene electrodes are time‐consuming, energy‐extensive, and complex multi‐step fabrications, limiting the large‐scale production of the materials. This study uses laser processing to fabricate HKUST‐1 MOF (Cu 3 (C 9 H 3 O 6 ) 2 )‐derived porous Cu‐Cu 2 O/C (L‐HKUST‐1) electrocatalyst under ambient conditions for the electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (E‐NRA). The swift, one‐pot, binder‐free, zero waste, and scalable laser processing technique enables directly printing Cu‐Cu 2 O nanoparticles embedded in a carbon matrix on the nickel substrate under ambient temperature and pressure. Chemical and morphological characterization corroborate the transformation of pristine HKUST‐1 to L‐HKUST‐1, thereby validating that the laser parameters (power, scan rate, resolution) are optimum for the successful fabrication of L‐HKUST‐1","au":["Aneena Lal","Hani Porat","Asmita Dutta","Manish Kumar Yadav","Arie Borenstein"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"激光诱导的 HKUST-1 衍生多孔电催化剂：一种提升可持续氨合成的新方法","zb":"研究对象为激光诱导制备的 HKUST-1 MOF（Cu3(C9H3O6)2）-衍生的多孔 Cu-Cu2O/C（L-HKUST-1）电催化剂，用于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨（E-NRA），通过激光加工技术直接在镍基底上制备 Cu-Cu2O 纳米颗粒嵌入碳基质，在常温常压下实现高效氨合成，最大氨产率为 13,871.58 ± 17.11 µg h −1 mg −1（-0.65 V vs RHE），法拉第效率为 80 ± 6.7%（-0.45 V）。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/bios15070407","t":"Gaseous Ammonia Sensing from Liquids via a Portable Chemosensor with Signal Correction for Humidity","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/bios15070407","s":"Biosensors","d":"2025-06-25","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia (NH3) detection in liquids and biological fluids is essential for monitoring environmental contamination and industrial processes, ensuring food safety, and diagnosing health conditions. Existing detection techniques are often unsuitable for point-of-care (POC) use due to limitations including complex sample handling, lack of portability, and poor compatibility with miniaturized systems. This study introduces a proof-of-concept for a compact, portable device tailored for POC detection of gaseous ammonia released from liquid samples. The device combines a polyaniline (PANI)-based chemoresistive sensor with interdigitated electrodes and a resistance readout circuit, enclosed in a gas-permeable hydrophobic membrane that permits ammonia in the vapor phase only to reach the sensing layer, ensuring selectivity and protection from liquid interference. The ink formulation was optimized. ","au":["Andrea Rescalli","Ilaria Porello","Pietro Cerveri","Francesco Cellesi"],"o":"回填","zt":"通过具有湿度信号校正功能的便携式化学传感器从液体中检测气态氨","zb":"开发了一种基于聚苯胺的便携式化学传感器，利用疏水膜选择性检测液样释放的气态氨。传感器在 1.7 至 170 ppm 浓度范围内表现出良好的线性相关性（R2 = 0.96–0.99），并成功校正了湿度干扰。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1007/s11426-025-2685-2","t":"Tuning Sn location in zeolites by atomic layer deposition to construct efficient Lewis acid catalysts for the Baeyer-Villiger oxidation reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11426-025-2685-2","s":"Science China Chemistry","d":"2025-06-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Kaili Zhao","Shaocheng Zhang","Zhiwei Wu","Xiaohan Wang","Qian Jiang","Shudong Liang"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积调控沸石中 Sn 的位置构建高效的路易斯酸催化剂用于贝克曼-维利格氧化反应","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5sc02208h","t":"Hydrogen-bond mediated electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia over metal–organic frameworks with industrial current density","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5sc02208h","s":"Chemical Science","d":"2025-06-24","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"A hydrogen bonding strategy is proposed to stabilize *NO 2 intermediates to improve the activity of the NO 3 − reduction reaction. The optimal DiMe-Cu 3 -MOF shows high NH 3 faradaic efficiency (95%) and large partial current density of −950.6 mA cm −2 .","au":["Xiao-Xue Fu","Hui Guo","Duan-Hui Si","Hong-Jing Zhu","Yi-Ying Lan","Yuan-Biao Huang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"氢键介导的电催化硝酸盐还原为氨：具有工业电流密度的金属有机框架","zb":"研究对象为氢键策略稳定NO2中间体以提高硝酸根还原反应活性，最优的DiMe-Cu3-MOF表现出95%的氨法拉第效率和-950.6 mA cm-2的较大部分电流密度。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/prechem.5c00038","t":"Precise Design of Nanoclusters for Efficient Nitrate-to-Ammonia Conversion","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/prechem.5c00038","s":"Precision Chemistry","d":"2025-06-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Atomically precise metal nanocluster (MNC) catalysts represent a significant advancement in electrocatalysis, particularly for the electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (eNO3RR). Their distinct structural features, which include precisely defined geometric and electronic configurations, enhance catalytic performance. Additionally, low nuclearity MNCs possess unique metallic properties that exhibit various active sites, optimizing the adsorption and conversion of nitrate intermediates. This functionality is vital for improving both reaction kinetics and selectivity during eNO3RR. Recent investigations have shown that by precisely adjusting the size, ligand, and composition of these nanoclusters, researchers can achieve specific electrochemical properties beneficial for eNO3RR. Capitalizing on their atomically precise nature can significantly enhance the efficiency and sustainability","au":["Shun Lu"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate-to-Ammonia"],"zt":"精确设计的纳米团簇用于高效的硝酸盐到氨转化","zb":"研究对象为原子精确金属纳米团簇(A atomically precise metal nanocluster)催化剂在电催化硝酸盐还原反应(eNO3RR)中的应用，其独特的几何和电子构型增强了催化性能。低核团簇具有独特的金属特性，表现出多种活性位点，优化了硝酸盐中间体的吸附和转化，提高了反应动力学和选择性。通过精确调整团簇的大小、配体和组成，可以实现有益于eNO3RR的特定电化学性质。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsomega.5c02559","t":"Photoinduced Nitrite Reduction to NO: Closing the Cycle with Dinuclear Ruthenium Complexes","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsomega.5c02559","s":"ACS Omega","d":"2025-06-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The reduction of nitrite to nitric oxide (NO) is a crucial step in the nitrogen cycle, catalyzed by nitrite reductase in nature, and its efficient catalysis is of great interest. This study reports the achievement of a reduction cycle that releases NO from nitrite using a dinuclear ruthenium complex (NO2– + 2H+ + e– → NO + H2O). Irradiation or thermolysis of a nitrite-bridged complex, [(TpRu)2(μ-Cl)­(μ-NO2)­(μ-pz)] (1) (Tp = HB­(pyrazol-1-yl)3), resulted in the formation of an oxido-bridged complex, [(TpRu)2(μ-Cl)­(μ-O)­(μ-pz)] (2), and the release of NO. The reaction mechanism from 1 to 2 was investigated through theoretical calculations. To complete the reduction cycle, complex 1 was reproduced from complex 2 using two protons and one electron in the presence of a nitrite salt. This study demonstrated the successful mimicking of the function of nitrite reductase using a dinucl","au":["Yasuhiro Arikawa","Shintaro Yoshida","Taiji Nakamura","Kenichiro Omoto","Eri Sakuda","Kazunari Yoshizawa"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrite Reduction"],"zt":"光诱导亚硝酸还原为一氧化氮：使用双核钌配合物闭合循环","zb":"研究对象为亚硝酸还原为一氧化氮的催化反应，使用双核钌配合物[(TpRu)2(μ-Cl)(μ-NO2)(μ-pz)]，通过光照射或热解产生氧化桥接配合物[(TpRu)2(μ-Cl)(μ-O)(μ-pz)]并释放一氧化氮。理论计算研究了从配合物1到配合物2的反应机理。配合物1在亚硝酸盐存在下由配合物2通过质子和电子再生，实现了亚硝酸还原酶功能的模拟。","ob":"通用催化方法"},{"id":"10.1021/acsenergylett.5c01389","t":"Ammonia Decomposition in the Presence of Water: A Resilient Barium Cobalt Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c01389","s":"ACS Energy Letters","d":"2025-06-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Thermocatalytic ammonia decomposition is a critical step in utilizing ammonia as a zero-emission fuel and energy carrier. Despite its industrial relevance, the impact of water─commonly added to ammonia to prevent tank and pipeline degradation by stress corrosion cracking─on catalyst performance remains largely unexplored. Here, we investigate the influence of trace water on the activity of Co- and Fe-based ammonia decomposition catalysts through a combined experimental and theoretical approach. Our findings reveal that while some promoted catalysts experience a detrimental activity loss, a barium-promoted cobalt catalyst demonstrates remarkable resilience, retaining most of its activity even at water concentrations up to 1%.","au":["Alexander Gunnarson","Oliver Christensen","Alexander Frisina","Miriam Varón","Emanuel R. Billeter","Christian D. Damsgaard"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"水存在下的氨分解：一种耐用的钡钴催化剂","zb":"通过实验和理论结合的方法研究了痕量水对钴基和铁基氨分解催化剂的影响。研究发现，一种钡助剂钴催化剂表现出卓越的耐水性，即使在高达 1% 的水浓度下，仍能保持大部分催化活性。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1080/17522439.2025.2521854","t":"Confronting the shadow: from ontological shock to perspectivism and post-traumatic growth after psychotic depression","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/17522439.2025.2521854","s":"Psychosis","d":"2025-06-24","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"This first-person account offers an insight into the ontological shock I encountered following recurrent episodes of psychotic depression. I describe how I explored different explanatory models of psychosis to overcome fear and find meaning in life. I use a bottom-up approach to reflect on my encounter with ontological shock after psychosis by relating my living experience to theory to centre my subjective experience. Ideas from perspectivism helped me to develop a new worldview or framework for understanding the nature of reality after psychosis. This helped me grapple with an overpowering sense of non-being after psychotic depression demolished my sense of personhood, who I thought I was and my sense of place in the world. It also helped me learn from my experiences. This piece supports the recommendation of others that more research should be undertaken to understand how alternative e","au":["Alison Walsh"],"o":"回填","zt":"直面阴影：从本体论冲击到视角主义和精神病性抑郁后的创伤后成长","zb":"这是一篇关于经历复发性精神病性抑郁后遭遇本体论冲击的第一人称叙述。作者探讨了不同的精神病学解释模型，并利用视角主义发展出一种新的世界观框架，以应对非存在感和自我认同的丧失。","ob":"通用催化方法"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-n5974","t":"Refined Atomic Layer Deposition in Metal-Organic Frameworks (AIM) for the Effective and Atom-Precise Introduction of Pt1-3 in Node-Accessible NU-1000","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-n5974","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-06-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Through the elaboration of standard atomic layer deposition (ALD) recipes to fit the properties of complex, porous metal-organic framework (MOF) substrates, it was possible to synthesize refined Pt-AIM@NU-1000 materials and advance the understanding of ALD in MOFs (AIM). It is generally understood that the post-synthetic functionalization of MOFs via the gas phase proves to be advantageous in comparison to its alternatives, like wet synthesis (e.g., impregnation) by an improved uniform metal dispersion or the elimination of time-consuming purification steps. These achievements can generally justify the use of the rather expensive and time-consuming ALD technique sufficiently, but simultaneously leave unfulfilled potential behind. By its nature, ALD promises the introduction of a high synthetic control which was now fully exploited to deposit Pt1-3 species in NU-1000 with exceptionally hi","au":["Laura Kronthaler","Alessandro Piovano","Valentina Crocellá","János Mink","Rachit Khare","Hana Bunzen"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"金属有机框架（MOF）中精确的 Pt1-3 引入：改进的原子层沉积（AIM）用于 NU-1000","zb":"通过优化原子层沉积（ALD）工艺以适应复杂多孔金属有机框架（MOF）基底的特性，实现了在节点可及的 NU-1000 中合成精确的 Pt-AIM@NU-1000 材料并推进了 ALD 在 MOFs（AIM）中的理解。ALD 通过气相后合成方法相比湿合成（如浸渍）具有优势，包括改善金属分散均匀性或消除耗时 purification 步骤。这项工作利用 ALD 的高合成控制性，在 NU-1000 中沉积 Pt1-3 物种，达到高达 28.4 wt. % 的 Pt 负载量。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202504174","t":"High‐Performance FeP Catalyst for Electrochemical Ammonia Production and Recovery via Joule‐Stripping","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202504174","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-06-23","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3","joule"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The electrochemical reduction of nitrate (NO₃RR) offers a promising route for decentralized and sustainable ammonia production while addressing environmental challenges associated with nitrate pollution. However, the development of practical implementations has been slowed by the challenge of creating highly stable and selective catalysts for strongly basic environments, along with the difficulty of efficiently recovering ammonia from dilute solutions. Here, we introduce a partially oxidized amorphous iron‐phosphide (POA‐FeP) electrocatalyst that combines high activity and stability with an innovative Joule‐stripping strategy for ammonia recovery. Electrodeposited onto nickel foam (NF), the POA‐FeP catalyst achieves benchmark partial current densities of −720 mA cm −2 in neutral media and −932 mA cm −2 in alkaline media, and near quantitative Faradaic efficiencies (FE). The robu","au":["Yuan‐Zi Xu","Robin N. Dürr","Florian Häfliger","Daniel F. Abbott","Victor Mougel"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production","Joule heat"],"zt":"用于电化学氨生产与回收的高性能 FeP 催化剂通过焦耳剥离","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原 (NO₃RR)，采用部分氧化的非晶态铁-磷化物 (POA-FeP) 催化剂，结合焦耳剥离策略进行氨回收。POA-FeP 催化剂电沉积在镍泡沫 (NF) 上，在中性介质中达到 -720 mA cm⁻² 的部分电流密度，在碱性介质中达到 -932 mA cm⁻²，法拉第效率 (FE) 接近定量。POA-FeP/NF 催化剂在 -300 mA cm⁻² 的总电流密度下连续运行超过 1000 小时，FE 保持在 90% 以上。电解槽在高电流密度下产生的焦耳热用于氨的挥发，随后以 >95% 的产率回收为固体氯化铵。这种集成焦耳剥离方法简化了氨回收，为可扩展和节能的硝酸盐还原系统开辟了新途径。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及Fe/铁体系","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202502344","t":"Enhanced Electrochemical Deuterated Ammonia (ND 3 ) Production via Microenvironment‐Regulated Nitrate Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202502344","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2025-06-23","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Deuterated ammonia (ND 3 ) has been widely used in pharmaceutical synthesis, chemical analysis, and semiconductor manufacturing, yet its conventional production suffers from high energy consumption, carbon emissions, and prohibitive costs. Here, an electrochemical approach is presented for ND 3 production under ambient conditions, achieving industrial‐scale performance through microenvironment regulations. Using a highly dispersed iron catalyst on nitrogen doped carbon support for nitrate reduction in D 2 O, the kinetic limitations of sluggish D 2 O dissociation are partially mitigated, reaching 80% ND 3 selectivity at 200 mA cm⁻ 2 . By identifying key reaction intermediates through in situ spectroscopy and combining their interfacial modulation (via tetraethylammonium, TEA⁺) with deuterium supply optimization (via KD 2 PO 4 ), ND 3 selectivity is further enhanced to 91%. Scalin","au":["Pan Zhu","Shangze Li","Jiangzhou Qin","Jianming Zhu","Jun Li","Kuichang Zuo"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"通过微环境调控的硝酸盐还原增强电化学氘代氨 (ND3) 生产","zb":"研究对象为氘代氨 (ND3) 生产，采用电化学方法在常温下实现，通过微环境调控达到工业级性能。使用高度分散的铁催化剂在氘代水 (D2O) 中对硝酸盐进行还原，部分缓解了 D2O 分解的动力学限制，在 200 mA cm⁻² 下达到 80% 的 ND3 选择性。通过原位光谱识别关键反应中间体，并结合四乙基铵 (TEA⁺) 的界面调制与 KD2PO4 的氘供应优化，ND3 选择性进一步提高至 91%。将过程扩展到 100 cm² 膜电极组件 (MEA) 类电解槽，验证了其可行性，在 2.7 V、5 A 下产生 23.1 mmol h⁻¹ ND3，选择性为 85%，成本降低 9 倍至每千克 6700–8700 美元（市场价格的 8–11%），与传统方法相比，生命周期分析 (LCA) 显示排放降低了 20–71%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3390/ma18132976","t":"Enhanced Reduction of Nitrate to Ammonia at the Co-N Heteroatomic Interface in MOF-Derived Porous Carbon","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/ma18132976","s":"Materials","d":"2025-06-23","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate is an efficient and green method for NH3 production. In this study, a Co-containing MOF with a stable three-dimensional carbon framework that offers abundant metal active sites is prepared as a precursor to a Co-N-C electrocatalyst. Facile pyrolysis of the three-dimensional MOF affords the desired Co-N-C electrocatalyst, which exhibits excellent stability, an NH3 yield of 1.12 mmol h−1 mg−1, and faradaic efficiency of 86.7% at −0.23 V in a 0.1 M KOH/0.1 M KNO3. The excellent activity and durability are ascribed to the highly exposed active centres, large surface area, and high porosity structure. N doping allows the electronic properties to be modulated and provides outstanding stability owing to the strong interaction between the nitrogen-doped carbon support and Co nanoparticles. This study presents a simple and efficient synthesis strategy for","au":["Jing Liu","Shuo Du","Zibin Huang","Ning Liu","Zhichao Shao","Na Qin"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 production"],"zt":"MOF衍生多孔碳中Co-N异原子界面对硝酸盐还原的增强作用","zb":"利用含Co的MOF作为前驱体，经热解制备出Co-N-C电催化剂。该催化剂在0.1 M KOH/0.1 M KNO3中，于-0.23 V下表现出86.7%的法拉第效率和1.12 mmol h−1 mg−1的氨产率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsenergylett.5c01034","t":"Plasma-Assisted Surface Nitridation of Proton Intercalatable WO 3 for Efficient Electrocatalytic Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsenergylett.5c01034","s":"ACS Energy Letters","d":"2025-06-22","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction (eNRR) offers a green pathway for the production of NH3 from N2 and H2O under ambient conditions. Transition metal oxynitrides (TMO x N y ) are among the most promising catalysts but face challenges in achieving a high yield and faradaic efficiency (FE). This work develops a hybrid WO x N y /WO3 catalyst with a unique heterogeneous interfacial complexion (HIC) structure. This design enables in situ generation and delivery of highly active hydrogen atoms (H*) in acidic electrolytes, promoting nitrogen hydrogenation and the formation of nitrogen vacancies (Nv) on the WO x N y surface. This significantly enhances the selectivity of eNRR for NH3 synthesis while suppressing the hydrogen evolution reaction (HER). A simple two-step fabrication processmicrowave hydrothermal growth followed by plasma-assisted surface nitridationwas developed to fabricate the ","au":["Zhiyuan Zhang","Christopher Kondratowicz","Jacob Smith","Pavel Kucheryavy","Junjie Ouyang","Yijie Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"等离子体辅助的 WO3 表面氮化用于高效的电化学氨合成","zb":"研究对象为电化学氮还原 (eNRR)，开发了一种具有独特非均相界面复合物 (HIC) 结构的 WOxNy/WO3 催化剂。该设计在酸性电解质中实现原位生成和传递高活性氢原子 (H*)，促进氮氢化并在 WOxNy 表面形成氮空位 (Nv)，显著提高 eNRR 对氨合成的选择性，同时抑制析氢反应 (HER)。采用微波水热生长和等离子体辅助表面氮化两步法制备催化剂电极，在酸性介质中实现 3.2 × 10–10 mol·cm–2·s–1 的氨产率，FE 为 40.1%，优于大多数 TMN/TMOxNy 电催化剂。控制实验证实 eNRR 遵循 HIC 增强型 Mars-van Krevelen (MvK) 机制。","ob":"等离子体制氨；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.5314793","t":"Unexpected Gas-Phase Nitrate Reduction on Ru/Ceo2: Implications for Green Ammonia Production","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5314793","s":"SSRN","d":"2025-06-21","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Herrero Alejandro","Freddy E. Oropeza","Laura Collado","Víctor Antonio de la Peña O'Shea"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Production"],"zt":"Ru/CeO2 上意外的气相硝酸根还原：对绿色氨生产的启示","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨；涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.18686/cest426","t":"Advances and challenges in discharge plasma-assisted catalyst synthesis and surface engineering","u":"https://doi.org/10.18686/cest426","s":"Clean Energy Science and Technology","d":"2025-06-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"The application of discharge plasma in catalyst preparation and modification is reviewed in this paper. Catalysts play a crucial role in various fields, and discharge plasma, with its unique physicochemical properties and environmental friendliness, shows great potential in the preparation and surface engineering of catalysts. Plasma can effectively activate reactant molecules under mild conditions, thereby enhancing the reaction rate, and regulate the microstructure and active site distribution of the catalysts, thereby improving the performance of specific catalytic reactions. In this paper, different plasma sources and discharge fundamentals are reviewed, mainly emphasising on the application of plasma in catalysts preparation and surface modification. The advantages and applications of plasma-assisted catalyst synthesis, plasma chemical vapor deposition and plasma atomic layer deposi","au":["Baolin Yu","Yuting Gao","Bohan Chen","Liangping Xiao","Rusen Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"放电等离子体辅助催化剂合成和表面工程的进展与挑战","zb":"本文回顾了放电等离子体在催化剂制备和改性中的应用。放电等离子体具有独特的物理化学性质和环保性，在催化剂制备和表面工程中显示出巨大潜力。等离子体可以在温和条件下有效活化反应物分子，从而提高反应速率，并调节催化剂的微观结构和活性位点分布，从而提高特定催化反应的性能。本文回顾了不同的等离子体源和放电基础，主要强调等离子体在催化剂制备和表面改性中的应用。讨论了等离子体辅助催化剂合成、等离子体化学气相沉积和等离子体原子层沉积的优势和应用。分析了等离子体对催化剂物理和化学性质的影响，以及这些改性对不同反应类型及其机理的影响。最后，讨论了未来研究方向和挑战，为放电等离子体技术在材料和催化科学中的发展提供参考。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.5c04950","t":"Tiara Ni Clusters for Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia with 97% Faradaic Efficiency","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c04950","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2025-06-20","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"The electroreduction of nitrate (NO3 –) for sustainable ammonia (NH3) production has recently emerged as a green process to solve water contamination and produce valuable chemicals. In this study, we developed Ni6@CuFe-LDH composites comprising tiara Ni6(SC2H4COOH)12 (Ni6) clusters anchored on the edges of 2D CuFe-LDH (LDH: layered double hydroxides) nanosheets via electrostatic interactions. The Ni6@CuFe-LDH catalyst exhibits high electrochemical performance in nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR). Specifically, the Ni6@CuFe-LDH gives rise to an excellent faradaic efficiency of ∼97%, significantly surpassing the ∼73% FE of the pristine CuFe-LDH, with the NH3 productivity (0.91 mmol mg–1 h–1) being similar to that of the CuFe-LDH. Mechanistic studies reveal that the superior electrocatalysis of Ni6-based catalysts is primarily due to the synergistic interaction between Ni6 clusters and CuF","au":["Xinrui Gu","Jingjing Zhang","Song Guo","Yifei Zhang","Liangliang Xu","Rongchao Jin"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"用于电化学硝酸盐还原为氨的 Tiara Ni 簇具有 97% 法拉第效率","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐 (NO3⁻) 还原，开发了一种包含 tiara Ni6(SC2H4COOH)12 (Ni6) 簇的 Ni6@CuFe-LDH 复合材料，通过静电相互作用锚定在二维 CuFe-LDH 纳米片边缘。Ni6@CuFe-LDH 催化剂在硝酸盐还原反应 (NO3RR) 中表现出优异的电化学性能，法拉第效率高达 ~97%，显著优于原始 CuFe-LDH 的 ~73%，氨生产力 (0.91 mmol mg–1 h–1) 与 CuFe-LDH 相似。机理研究表明，Ni6 基催化剂的优越电催化性能主要归因于 Ni6 簇与 CuFe-LDH 的协同作用，该作用改变了决速步骤 (RDS)，将原始 CuFe-LDH 的 *NH3 物种解吸步骤转变为 Ni6@CuFe-LDH 的 *NO3 → *NO2 步骤；这一结论通过 NO2RR 控制实验、原位拉曼和红外光谱以及计算方法得到证实。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c02252","t":"Oxygen Poisoning of Copper Surfaces in the Presence of Cesium Ions during Electrochemical Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c02252","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2025-06-20","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrate reduction (NO 3 R) for ammonia synthesis holds promise for utilizing NO 3 – pollutants in water under ambient conditions. In the multielectron transfer process of NO 3 – anions transforming into ammonia, counter-cations play a critical role in influencing the interactions of anions and intermediates. Here, we investigated the impact of Cs + ions on the electropolished flat copper (Cu) (100) surface during NO 3 R. Our results show that the presence of Cs + leads to a significant decline in Cu activity, with an approximately 8-fold decrease in the partial current density for NH 3 and an increase in interfacial resistance compared to using K + . Operando electrochemical Raman spectroscopy revealed the formation of oxygen and hydroxide species adsorbed on the surface (Cu-*O and Cu-*OH, the asterisk symbol indicates surface adsorption), alongside a decrease in the ","au":["Minyoung Shim","Jinyoung Ko","Yohan Kim","Yousung Jung","Hye Ryung Byon"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"铯离子存在下铜表面在电化学硝酸盐还原为氨过程中的氧中毒","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原 (NO₃R)，研究铯离子 (Cs⁺) 对电抛光平坦铜 (Cu) (100) 表面在 NO₃⁻ 还原为氨过程中的影响。Cs⁺ 存在导致 Cu 活性显著下降，NH₃ 的部分电流密度降低约 8 倍，界面电阻增加。原位电化学拉曼光谱显示 Cs⁺ 存在时表面吸附了氧和氢氧物种 (Cu-*O 和 Cu-*OH)，NO₃⁻ 中间体的信号减弱。同位素标记实验 (N18O3⁻) 确定了一个关键的脱氧途径，涉及 N18O2 和 18O 物种的形成。这种由吸附氧物种积累导致的 Cu 表面失活在碱性条件下尤为明显，并在其他铜表面 facet（如 Cu (111)）上观察到。密度泛函理论 (DFT) 计算解释了氧原子 (*O) 在 Cu 表面被稳定的原因是由于 Cs⁺ 离子与水合水的弱氢键，而 K⁺ 离子与更强的氢键促进了氧的去除。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta03155a","t":"Self-evolution induced Cu x O/Fe 3 O 4 heterogeneous interfaces enabling rapid nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta03155a","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2025-06-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"A reconstructed Cu x O/Fe 3 O 4 heterointerface boosts tandem nitrate-to-ammonia conversion: Cu x O catalyzes NO 2 − formation, Fe 3 O 4 hydrogenates intermediates to NH 3 , aided by interfacial charge redistribution and reduced energy barriers.","au":["Yingjie Xia","Xin Li","Yansen Qu","Yi Zhou","Ziyang Weng","Shengming Jin"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate-to-ammonia"],"zt":"自进化诱导的 Cu x O/Fe 3 O 4 多相界面实现快速硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为 Cu x O/Fe 3 O 4 多相界面，关键方法为界面重构，主要结果为 Cu x O 催化 NO 2 − 生成，Fe 3 O 4 氢化中间体为 NH 3 ，界面电荷重分布和能垒降低起作用。","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.3390/molecules30132680","t":"Thermal Interaction Mechanisms of Ammonium Perchlorate and Ammonia Borane","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/molecules30132680","s":"Molecules","d":"2025-06-20","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Ammonia borane (AB), with a theoretical hydrogen content of 19.6 wt%, is constrained by its low crystalline density (0.758 g/cm3) and poor thermal stability (decomposing at 100 °C). In this study, AB/ammonium perchlorate (AP) composites were synthesized via freeze-drying at a 1:1 molar ratio. The integration of AP introduced intermolecular interactions that suppressed AB decomposition, increasing the onset temperature by 80 °C. Subsequent vacuum calcination at 100 °C for 2 h formed oxygen/fuel-integrated ammonium perchlorate borane (APB), which achieved decomposition temperatures exceeding 350 °C. The proposed mechanism involved AB decomposing into borazine and BN polymers at 100 °C, which then NH3BH2+/ClO4− combined to form APB. At 350 °C, APB underwent the following redox reactions: 4NH3BH2ClO4 → N2↑ + 4HCl↑ + 2B2O3 + N2O↑ + O2↑ + 7H2O↑ + H2↑, while residual AP decomposed. The composit","au":["Yunlong Zhang","Rui Pu","Shaoli Chen","Qilong Yan"],"o":"回填","zt":"高氯酸铵和氨硼烷的热相互作用机制","zb":"通过冷冻干燥法制备了1:1摩尔比的氨硼烷（AB）/高氯酸铵（AP）复合材料。AP的引入抑制了AB的分解，使起始分解温度提高了80 °C。真空煅烧形成的氧/燃料集成高氯酸铵硼烷（APB）分解温度超过350 °C，密度达到1.66 g/cm3。","ob":"氨硼烷水解"},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202500159","t":"The Haber Bosch Catalyst from Solid state Chemistry to Mesotechnology","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202500159","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2025-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":32,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia is industrially synthesized over multi‐promoted Fe‐based catalysts for more than a century. Although ammonia synthesis reflects a prototypical catalytic reaction, rational catalyst design is still impossible as the full structural complexity of this catalyst system often referred to as ammonia iron and its structural entanglement is barely understood. Here, the mesoscopic structure of a technical, multi‐promoted ammonia synthesis catalyst is uncovered using a scale‐bridging electron microscopy approach complemented by X‐ray diffraction and spectroscopy to explore the structural integrity of ammonia iron. Amorphous contributions and structures of the melilite type and tricalcium aluminate as additional phases are identified. Furthermore, the understanding of the ammonia iron family by unveiling the role of the platelet‐Fe perimeter, framework Fe, thin film Fe, and refract","au":["Kassiogé Dembélé","Jihao Wang","Maxime Boniface","Jan Folke","Luis Sandoval Diaz","Frank Girgsdies"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"从固态化学到介观技术的哈伯-博施催化剂","zb":"利用跨尺度电子显微镜结合X射线衍射和光谱技术，揭示了多助剂Fe基哈伯-博施催化剂的介观结构。研究识别了非晶相、橄榄石型和三铝酸钙等结构，并阐明了板状Fe边缘、骨架Fe、薄膜Fe和耐高温Fe的相互作用。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨；涉及Fe/铁体系","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202504632","t":"Fabrication of High‐Loading Single Atom Catalysts for Energy‐related Catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202504632","s":"Small","d":"2025-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":15,"ab":"Abstract Heterogeneous single‐atom catalysts (SACs) have emerged as a new frontier in the field of energy‐related catalysis owing to the maximum atomic utilization efficiency, unique electronic and geometric properties compared with traditional nano‐catalysts. Nevertheless, it is still a great challenge to fabricate high‐loading SACs, since these isolated metal sites with high surface free energy are apt to assemble into clusters or particles with a high metal content. This review summarizes recent advancements for high‐loading SACs, and mainly focuses on the synthetic strategies, unique interatomic interactions, together with their applications in different chemical reactions, including photocatalysis, electrocatalysis, and thermocatalysis. Specifically, strategies that consist of wet‐chemistry, atomic layer deposition, ball milling, pyrolysis, chemical vapor deposition, laser ablation,","au":["Xiaohui Sun","Bangyang Zhang","Peng Zhang","Jiansong Miao","Chunming Xu"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"高负载量单原子催化剂的制备","zb":"多相单原子催化剂（SACs）由于与传统纳米催化剂相比具有最大原子利用效率、独特的电子和几何性质，已成为能源相关催化领域的新前沿。然而，制备高负载量 SACs 仍然是一个巨大挑战，因为这些具有高表面自由能的孤立金属位点容易组装成高金属含量的簇或颗粒。本综述总结了高负载量 SACs 的新进展，主要关注合成策略、独特的原子间相互作用及其在光催化、电催化和热催化等不同化学反应中的应用。具体而言，首先概述了用于制备高负载量 SACs 的湿化学、原子层沉积、球磨、热解、化学气相沉积、激光消融和电沉积等策略。进一步描述了高负载量 SACs 中独特的原子间相互作用，包括电荷转移和能带结构变化、自旋状态和反应途径的变化。然后，讨论了多相催化中高负载量 SACs 的实例，以说明其几何和电子性质与催化性能以及反应机理之间的关系。最后，提出了本综述的结论，并对该领域的挑战和前景进行了展望。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta02087e","t":"Construction of bimetallic CoCu@BC for sustainable ammonia synthesis with minimal nitrite accumulation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta02087e","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2025-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrate (NO3−) reduction reaction (NO3RR) is hindered by nitrite (NO2−) accumulation and the competing hydrogen evolution reaction, limiting the faradaic efficiency (FE) and selectivity of ammonia (NH3) production....","au":["Xiaofeng Xu","Ziyu Wang","Zhongyan Zhang","Pengfei Guo","Di Shen","Tianyi Wei"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"构建双金属 CoCu@BC 用于可持续氨合成且亚硝酸积累最小","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原反应 (NO3RR)，关键方法为构建双金属 CoCu@BC 载体，主要结果为抑制亚硝酸 (NO2−) 积累，提高氨 (NH3) 选择性和法拉第效率 (FE)。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/catal15060603","t":"Density Functional Theory Study of Nitrogen Reduction to Ammonia on Bilayer Borophene","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/catal15060603","s":"Catalysts","d":"2025-06-19","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The N2 reduction reaction (NRR) under ambient conditions is highly desirable because of its potential to replace the energy-consuming Haber-Bosch process for ammonia production. In recent years, much attention has been devoted to transition metal-based catalysts. However, the development of metal-free electrocatalysts remains a great challenge. Here, the electrocatalytic performance of bilayer borophene is systematically studied based on first-principles calculations. It was found that bilayer borophene has high activity with an overpotential of 0.21 V via the enzymatic mechanism. Bond elongations of nitrogen bond are observed in end-on and side-on patterns, where the bond lengths are stretched to 1.13 and 1.21 Å, respectively. Around 0.36 e− is transferred to the adsorbed N2 with the contribution of bottom boron atoms. Our results propose bilayer borophene as a novel metal-free catalyst","au":["Fuyong Qin"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"氮还原为氨在双层硼烯上的密度泛函理论研究","zb":"研究对象为双层硼烯，关键方法为第一性原理计算，主要结果为双层硼烯具有高活性，过电位为 0.21 V，通过酶促机制，氮键伸长至 1.13 和 1.21 Å，转移约 0.36 e−。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.3390/ma18122892","t":"Understanding the Synthesis of Turbostratic/Flash Graphene via Joule Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/ma18122892","s":"Materials","d":"2025-06-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The introduction of the Joule heating (JH) method for synthesizing turbostratic graphene has attracted considerable attention from researchers due to its promising potential for commercialization compared to earlier techniques. Numerous studies have outlined the technology’s basic operation and how parameters such as electric field, operating time, and temperature influence the quality and type of graphene produced. Despite this, there is still a lack of concise and comprehensive studies that exclusively focus on the JH method with turbostratic graphene as the target product. This review article is a facile attempt to provide the scientific community with an overview of the historical development and operational principles of Joule heating. It also discusses the structural and fundamental differences between turbostratic and conventional graphene, along with methodologies for characteriz","au":["Faisal Mahmood","Christian Fabrice Magoua Mbeugang","Furqan Asghar","Xing Xie","Dan Lin","Dongjing Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"通过焦耳热合成涡轮石/闪速石墨烯的理解","zb":"焦耳热（JH）方法用于合成涡轮石石墨烯的引入，由于与早期技术相比具有商业化前景，已引起研究人员的极大关注。大量研究概述了该技术的基本操作以及电场、操作时间和温度等参数如何影响产生的石墨烯的质量和类型。尽管如此，仍然缺乏专门针对焦耳热方法和涡轮石石墨烯作为目标产品的简洁而全面的研究。本综述文章是一个简单的尝试，向科学界概述焦耳热的歷史发展和操作原理。它还讨论了涡轮石和传统石墨烯之间的结构和基本差异，以及表征涡轮石石墨烯的方法。此外，分析了通过 JH 合成涡轮石石墨烯的机制，并提出了该方法的未来前景。","ob":"电场辅助，未证实焦耳供热"},{"id":"10.1101/2025.06.16.660007","t":"Single administration of mosaic-8b RBD-nanoparticle vaccine prepared with atomic layer deposition technology elicits broadly neutralizing anti-sarbecovirus responses","u":"https://doi.org/10.1101/2025.06.16.660007","s":"bioRxiv","d":"2025-06-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"SUMMARY Atomic layer deposition (ALD), a new vaccine technology, permits multiple dosing with a single administration by pulsatile release of one or more immunogens. We evaluated ALD delivery of mosaic-8b [60-mer nanoparticles presenting 8 different SARS-like betacoronavirus (sarbecovirus) receptor-binding domains (RBDs)] that elicits broadly cross-reactive antibodies and protects against mismatched sarbecoviruses not represented by RBDs on mosaic-8b. Compared with conventional prime-boost immunizations, ALD-delivered mosaic-8b RBD-nanoparticles elicited antibodies in both naïve and pre-vaccinated mice with improved mismatched binding and neutralization. Results of RBD epitope mapping of serum antibodies from ALD-delivered mosaic-8b were consistent with broader coverage of RBD epitopes compared to conventional immunizations, and systems serology revealed distinct IgG subclass and FcγR-bi","au":["Alexander A. Cohen","Jennifer R. Keeffe","Annie V. Rorick","Semi Rho","Ange-Celia Priso Fils","Lusineh Manasyan"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"通过原子层沉积技术制备的八构型 mosaic-8b RBD-纳米颗粒疫苗的单次给药激发广谱中和性抗沙贝科病毒反应","zb":"原子层沉积（ALD）是一种新的疫苗技术，通过脉冲释放一种或多种免疫原，允许单次给药多次接种。我们评估了 ALD 递送的 mosaic-8b [60-mer 纳米颗粒呈递 8 种不同的 SARS 样贝塔冠状病毒（沙贝科病毒）受体结合域（RBDs）] 所激发的广谱交叉反应性抗体和保护作用，这些抗体可以保护 mosaic-8b 上未表示的 RBDs 所代表的错配沙贝科病毒。与传统的 prime-boost 免疫接种相比，ALD 递送的 mosaic-8b RBD-纳米颗粒在未免疫和预先免疫的小鼠中激发了抗体，改善了错配结合和中和。ALD 递送的 mosaic-8b 的血清抗体 RBD 表位图谱的结果与传统的免疫接种相比，RBD 表位覆盖范围更广一致，系统血清学揭示了不同的 IgG 亚类和 FcγR 结合 IgG 分布。这些结果表明，ALD 是一种很有前景的技术，可用于 mosaic-8b RBD","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202507956","t":"Cascade Electrocatalytic Reduction of Nitrate to Ammonia Using Bimetallic Covalent Organic Frameworks with Tandem Active Sites","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202507956","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-06-18","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) is a promising approach to simultaneously realize pollutant removal and ammonia generation. However, this process involves the transfer of eight electrons and nine protons along with multiple by‐products, resulting in a significant challenge for achieving high ammonia yield and selectivity. Herein, we introduced bimetallic covalent organic frameworks catalysts with Cu and Co active sites to achieve a two‐step tandem reaction, avoiding excessive nitrite accumulation and enabling efficient NO 3 RR. For the initial two‐electron process, the Cu sites in the bimetallic catalyst exhibit a strong binding affinity with nitrate, promoting their conversion to nitrite. The Co sites enhance the supply and adsorption of active hydrogen and stabilize the subsequent six‐electron process, thereby improving the overall catalytic efficiency. Co","au":["Jian Zhong","Haiyan Duan","Mingquan Cai","Ying Zhu","Zhenlin Wang","Xingchi Li"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate to Ammonia"],"zt":"使用具有串联活性位点的双金属共价有机框架进行硝酸盐级联电催化还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原反应 (NO3RR)，关键方法为引入具有 Cu 和 Co 活性位点的双金属共价有机框架催化剂，主要结果为 CuCo 催化剂实现两步串联反应，避免过量亚硝酸积累，氨产率率为 20.8 mg·h −1 ·cm −2 ，法拉第效率 (FE) = 92.16%。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1039/d5ta02808f","t":"Electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia using a bifunctional Ni–Mo alloy catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ta02808f","s":"Journal of Materials Chemistry A","d":"2025-06-18","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) with water as hydrogen source provides opportunities for ammonia production but suffers from a limited activity due to the difficulty of activating both H2O and...","au":["Miao Zhao","Ruizhi Duan","Zicong Zhang","Qi Mao","Qingnan Wang","Yiyang Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"使用 Ni–Mo 合金催化剂电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为电化学硝酸盐还原反应 (NO3RR)，关键方法为使用 Ni–Mo 合金催化剂，主要结果为水作为氢源，提高氨 (NH3) 产率。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.5c06917","t":"Surface Entropy-Reduction Tailored Few-Atom Layer Metal on High-Entropy Alloy for Tandem Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.5c06917","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2025-06-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"To kill two birds in one stone, electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate (NO3-) offers a mild and reliable approach for wastewater denitrification and a green pathway for ammonia (NH3) production. Despite the complex proton-coupled electron transfer process in NO3- reduction, efficient NH3 production has been challenging. In this study, high-entropy multivalent chalcogenides (HEMCs) were synthesized, exhibiting a synergistic catalytic effect for enhanced electrochemical performance. The highest Faraday efficiency of 92.3% and NH3 yield rate of 5.67 mg h-1 cm-2 were achieved at -0.6 and -0.8 V versus reversible hydrogen electrode (V vs RHE) under the catalysis of HEMC with Fe, Cu, Co, Cr, Zr, Ni, and Bi (molar ratio 1:1:1:1:1:1:1), denoted as F3CZNB. Comparatively, senary and quinary HEMCs, namely, F3CZN and F3CZ, were also synthesized. Characterization and catalytic performance analyses rev","au":["Lixue Zhou","Daming Feng","Zhiqiang Li","Zhenghao Lv","Hui Li","Chunhua Ge"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 production"],"zt":"表面熵降低定制少量原子层金属在高温合金上用于串联电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"合成了高温多价硫族化合物(HEMCs)，表现出协同催化效应以增强电化学性能。在Fe、Cu、Co、Cr、Zr、Ni和Bi（摩尔比1:1:1:1:1:1:1）的HEMC催化下，最高法拉第效率为92.3%，氨产率为5.67 mg h-1 cm-2，在-0.6和-0.8 V相对于可逆氢电极(V vs RHE)下实现。比较合成了六元和五元HEMCs，即F3CZN和F3CZ。表征和催化性能分析表明，Fe和Cu主要贡献催化活性，而氨选择性和电极稳定性归因于金属的化学计量组成。Ni通过其亲水性进一步增强了NO3-转化为NH3的转化率，Bi通过过渡金属与d-p相互作用改善了导电性和耐久性。使用原位傅里叶变换红外光谱(in situ FT-IR)和电化学差分质量光谱(DEMS)检测了催化剂表面的中间体(*NO2, *NO, *NH2OH, *NH2和*NH)，证实了NO3-还原反应途径。装配了F3CZNB的Z","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.energyfuels.5c01772","t":"Cobalt-Promoted Ni/Al 2 O 3 Catalyst for Efficient Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.energyfuels.5c01772","s":"Energy & Fuels","d":"2025-06-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"We synthesize and characterize a series of γ-Al 2 O 3 -supported monometallic (9Ni/Al, 12Ni/Al, 12Co/Al) and bimetallic (12Ni x Co/Al, where x = 3 and 1) catalysts and evaluate their catalytic performance in the NH 3 decomposition reaction. We also use the Temkin–Pyzhev rate law to determine the relevant parameters for the five catalysts. The bimetallic catalysts reveal a higher degree of reduction and smaller particle size than the monometallic catalysts, resulting in a larger effective alloy surface area. Peak shifts in the X-ray diffraction (XRD) patterns of the reduced bimetallic catalysts confirm the formation of a Ni–Co alloy, which is further corroborated by analysis of other characterization techniques. Kinetic studies reveal that NH 3 decomposition follows the Temkin–Pyzhev rate law, and an increase in NH 3 and/or H 2 partial pressure decreases the conversion. The synergy betwee","au":["Pradeep Kumar Yadav","Jitendra Kumar Prabhakar","Goutam Deo"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"钴助剂镍/氧化铝催化剂用于高效氨分解","zb":"合成并表征了一系列氧化铝负载的单金属(9Ni/Al, 12Ni/Al, 12Co/Al)和双金属(12Ni x Co/Al, 其中x=3和1)催化剂，并评估了它们在氨分解反应中的催化性能。使用Temkin-Pyzhev速率定律确定了五种催化剂的相关参数。双金属催化剂比单金属催化剂具有更高的还原程度和更小的粒径，导致更大的有效合金表面积。还原的双金属催化剂的X射线衍射(XRD)图谱中的峰位移证实了Ni-Co合金的形成，这进一步由其他表征技术得到证实。动力学研究表明，氨分解遵循Temkin-Pyzhev速率定律，氨和/或氢气的分压增加会降低转化率。Ni和Co之间的协同作用降低了氨分解的能垒，并减少了氢气的抑制作用。值得注意的是，12Ni 3 Co/Al催化剂表现出最低的表观活化能42.8 kJ/mol。该催化剂还显示出最高的有效合金表面积。因此，12Ni 3 Co/Al的最佳催化性能归因于合金","ob":"氨分解制氢"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.jpclett.5c01120","t":"Cascading of Thermocatalysis and Electrocatalysis for Enhanced Nitrogen Reduction on the Dual-Atom Cobalt Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jpclett.5c01120","s":"The Journal of Physical Chemistry Letters","d":"2025-06-17","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrochemical ammonia (NH3) synthesis is an attractive approach for nitrogen fixation due to its advantages in operating under mild conditions and using compact production facilities. However, it faces technoeconomic challenges, such as slow N2 conversions. In recent years, N≡N bond activation has been reported by either enhancing the \"acceptance-donation\" mechanism on a single atomic site or stretching the bond length of N2 on dual atomic sites. In either approach, nevertheless, the concerted proton-electron transfer (CPET) that activates *N2 directly to *NNH exhibits sluggish reaction kinetics. Here, we demonstrate that *N2 can be feasibly hydrogenated via a thermally and electrically cascaded mechanism on a dual Co atom catalyst (Co2-C3N4). To be specific, when the N2 bonds with one of the Co atoms in Co2-C3N4, the CPET occurs at adjacent C atoms rather than *N2, resulting in a *H(C","au":["Xing Fan","Jianhua Wang","Jiangdong Bo","Zhengda Chen","Guoxin Zhang","Xinying Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen fixation"],"zt":"热催化与电催化级联增强双原子钴催化剂上的氮还原","zb":"电化学氨（NH3）合成是一种有吸引力的氮固定方法，因为它在温和条件下操作并使用紧凑的生产设施。然而，它面临技术经济挑战，例如氮气（N2）转化率慢。近年来，通过增强单原子位点上的“接受-捐赠”机制或将N2的键长在双原子位点上拉伸来激活N≡N键已被报道。在任一方法中，尽管如此，激活*N2直接到*NNH的协同质子-电子转移（CPET）表现出缓慢的反应动力学。在这里，我们证明了*N2可以通过热和电级联机制在双原子钴催化剂（Co2-C3N4）上可行地氢化。具体来说，当N2与Co2-C3N4中的一个Co原子结合时，CPET发生在相邻的C原子而不是*N2上，导致一个*H(C)-*N2(Co)中间态。然后，通过从C到*N2的热活化逐步H迁移，可以形成关键状态*NNH。相应地，N2到氨的电化学还原可以在低工作电位下进行。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.55529/jeet.51.12.22","t":"Joule heating and dielectric gradient effects on colloidal particle electrophoresis","u":"https://doi.org/10.55529/jeet.51.12.22","s":"Journal of Energy Engineering and Thermodynamics","d":"2025-06-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The following paper discusses the combined action of dielectric gradients and Joule heating effects to the electrophoresis of colloids in micro fluidics. Study introduces a new and useful CFD model that represents the combination of the Joule heating and dielectrophoresis phenomenon to expose the opposite particle dynamics in microchannels when the electric field is applied. The influence of the temperature gradients on the equivalent representation of the electrokinetic forces as well as the particles mobility is included by taking into consideration the temperature-dependent fluid viscosity and dielectric permittivity. These outcomes prove the fact that Joule heating can substantially change the particle velocity by changing the physical parameters of the fluid used, whereas dielectric gradients also bring new dielectrophoretic forces which can impact on the movement of the particles. ","au":["Dr. Ujjwal Kanti Ghoshal","Ravish Kumar"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"焦耳热和介电梯度对胶体颗粒电泳的影响","zb":"研究讨论了介电梯度和焦耳热效应对微流控中胶体电泳的联合作用。引入了一个新的CFD模型，表示焦耳热和介电泳现象的结合，揭示在施加电场时微通道中相反的颗粒动力学。通过考虑温度相关的流体粘度和介电常数，研究了温度梯度对电动力学力的等效表示以及颗粒移动性的影响。结果表明，焦耳热可以通过改变流体的物理参数来显著改变颗粒速度，而介电梯度也会产生新的介电泳力，影响颗粒的运动。这是一种优化生物分子分离和纳米颗粒控制应用的微流控平台的综合方法。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜电场辅助，未证实焦耳供热"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202505616","t":"Relay‐Enhanced Electron Transfer in Triple‐Layer Ru@Ir@Pt Core–Shell Nanoparticles for the Ammonia Oxidation Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202505616","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-06-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract Ammonia oxidation reaction (AOR) is important for enabling the efficient use of NH 3 as a promising carrier for hydrogen storage and transportation. However, the catalytic activity of state‐of‐the‐art Pt‐based catalysts decreases significantly due to the strong adsorption of N species. In this study, a triple‐layer core–shell structured Ru@Ir@Pt model catalyst was employed to demonstrate that the relay electron transfer strategy can decelerate the adsorption of N species and increase AOR activity, a process facilitated by the built‐in electric field (BEF) induced by differing work functions that drive the sequential relay of charge transfer across the interfaces between different metals. In situ Fourier Transform Infrared (FTIR) spectroscopy revealed that AOR proceeds primarily via the N 2 H 4 pathway of the G–M mechanism. Both the experimental and theoretical simulation results","au":["Chenchen Wang","Jingtao Li","Yuan Yuan","Bo Ouyang","Zengsheng Guo","Cuiping Lin"],"o":"回填","zt":"三明治层Ru@Ir@Pt核壳纳米颗粒中继增强电子转移用于氨氧化反应","zb":"采用三明治层核壳结构Ru@Ir@Pt模型催化剂，证明了中继电子转移策略可以减缓N物种的吸附并增加AOR活性，该过程由不同金属的功函数差异引起的内置电场(BEF)促进，驱动电荷在金属界面之间顺序转移。原位傅里叶变换红外(FTIR)光谱揭示，AOR主要通过G-M机制的N2H4途径进行。实验和理论模拟结果均证实，由内置电场引起的中继电子转移使最外层的Pt电子富集状态降低了吸附物种的强度，并降低了AOR决速步骤的能量势垒，从而实现了优异的活性，质量活性高达363.5 A g −1。该值是20% Pt/C的5.24倍，显著超过先前报道的大多数催化剂。这项工作为开发高性能先进氨氧化电催化剂提供了一种新的材料设计方法。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.3390/cleantechnol7020049","t":"Transitioning Ammonia Production: Green Hydrogen-Based Haber–Bosch and Emerging Nitrogen Reduction Technologies","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/cleantechnol7020049","s":"Clean Technologies","d":"2025-06-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia production is a cornerstone of the modern chemical industry, essential for fertilizer manufacturing and increasingly relevant in the energy sector. However, the conventional Haber–Bosch (HB) process is highly energy- and carbon-intensive, contributing significantly to global greenhouse gas emissions, releasing approximately 1.6 tonnes of carbon dioxide for every tonne of ammonia produced. In the context of the ongoing climate crisis, exploring sustainable alternatives that can reduce or even eradicate these emissions is imperative. This review examines the potential of ammonia as a future energy carrier and evaluates the transition to green hydrogen-based HB production. Key technologies for green hydrogen generation are reviewed in conjunction with environmental, energy, and economic considerations. The transition to a green hydrogen-based HB process has been demonstrated to offe","au":["Cátia Ribeiro","Diogo M. F. Santos"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"向氨生产转型：基于绿色氢的哈伯-博施工艺和新兴氮还原技术","zb":"氨生产是现代化学工业的基石，对化肥制造和能源领域至关重要。然而，传统的哈伯-博施（HB）工艺高度依赖能源和碳，每生产一吨氨会释放约1.6吨二氧化碳。本综述探讨了氨作为未来能源载体的潜力，并评估了向基于绿色氢的HB工艺的转型。绿色氢的生成技术、环境、能源和经济因素被审查。与传统能源相比，基于绿色氢的HB工艺可减少高达八倍的碳排放。此外，在低成本可再生能源条件下，无论是使用固体氧化物电解槽还是质子交换膜电解器，该工艺的经济可行性尤为突出。此外，还分析了两种新兴的无排放电化学氨合成路线的方法、效率和经济效益。直接和间接氮还原方法均取得了显著进展。间接锂介导途径显示出最大的潜力，显著降低了氨生产成本。尽管存在效率等挑战，但这些新兴技术提供了分散化、电气化的路径。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1088/1361-6595/addc54","t":"Plasma-catalytic ammonia generation and plasma-chemical nitrogen oxidation in a ‘hybrid’ ns pulse/RF discharge","u":"https://doi.org/10.1088/1361-6595/addc54","s":"Plasma Sources Science and Technology","d":"2025-06-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract Plasma-catalytic ammonia synthesis in a ‘hybrid’ ns pulse/RF discharge, operated in the repetitive burst mode, is studied by Fourier transform infrared absorption spectroscopy. The data are taken in preheated H 2 -N 2 mixtures, with and without Ni/ γ -Al 2 O 3 , Rh/ γ -Al 2 O 3 , and Ru/ γ -Al 2 O 3 catalyst placed in the plasma flow reactor. The sub-breakdown RF waveform added to the ns pulse bursts is used to isolate the effect of the enhanced vibrational excitation of N 2 on ammonia and nitric oxide yields. The enhancement of the N 2 vibrational temperature in the hybrid N 2 –H 2 plasma has been demonstrated in our previous work. Adding the RF waveform results in a reproducible increase of the ammonia yield, measured over the ‘blank’ alumna, Ni, Rh, and Ru catalyst samples, by up to 25% compared to the ns pulse discharge operating alone. The yield enhancement in the empty rea","au":["Matthew Berry","Sai Raskar","Xin Yang","Igor V Adamovich"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"在‘混合’ns脉冲/射频放电中等离子体催化氨生成和等离子体化学氮氧化","zb":"通过傅里叶变换红外吸收光谱研究了在重复脉冲模式下运行的‘混合’ns脉冲/射频放电中的等离子体催化氨合成。数据是在预热过的H2-N2混合物中，以及没有Ni/ γ -Al 2 O 3 , Rh/ γ -Al 2 O 3 , 和Ru/ γ -Al 2 O 3 催化剂放置在等离子体流反应器中的情况下采集的。我们之前的工作中已经证明了在混合N2–H2等离子体中N2振动温度的提高。添加射频波形导致氨产率在相对于单独ns脉冲放电的‘空白’氧化铝、Ni、Rh和Ru催化剂样品上可重复地增加，高达25%。空反应器（没有氧化铝或催化剂样品）中的产率增加要显著低得多，约为10%。这表明暴露于等离子体的表面是射频增强的关键因素。该效应与每个爆发中射频增强脉冲的数量成正比。在一个密切相关实验中，将混合ns/RF放电在空反应器中激发的O2–N2混合物中的NO产率与单独ns脉冲放电在相同条件下的NO产率进行了比较。检测到","ob":"等离子体制氨；涉及Ru/钌体系｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.est.5c04984","t":"Chlorine-Mediated Ammonia and Organics Transformation during Electrochemical Ammonia Recovery from Human Urine","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.est.5c04984","s":"Environmental Science & Technology","d":"2025-06-16","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Electrochemical technology offers efficient ammonia recovery from waste streams. While human urine is a nitrogen-rich resource, its complexity presents challenges, including chlorine-mediated ammonia oxidation and disinfection byproduct formation in the electrochemical process. In this study, we investigate these important issues in a stacked electrochemical system. In situ electrochemical Raman spectroscopy, Fourier Transform ion cyclotron resonance mass spectrometry, and stopped-flow techniques were used to examine chlorine evolution and dissolved organic matter (DOM) transformation. Results showed minor ammonia loss due to chlorination because the Cl2-to-nitrogen ratio was significantly lower than the breakpoint ratio under anodic conditions (pH < 1.5). However, the generated active chlorine induced hydrogen abstraction and chlorine addition to unsaturated bonds, forming chlorinated D","au":["Jiazhou He","Chi Zhang","Yi Yang","Jiawen Kang","Changyong Zhang","Di He"],"o":"回填","zt":"氯介导的氨和有机物转化在从人尿中电化学回收氨过程中","zb":"电化学技术提供了一种从废物流中高效回收氨的方法。虽然人尿是一种富含氮的资源，但其复杂性带来了挑战，包括电化学过程中氯介导的氨氧化和消毒副产物的形成。本研究在一个堆叠电化学系统中调查了这些问题。使用原位电化学拉曼光谱、傅里叶变换离子回旋共振质谱和停止流技术来检查氯气析出和溶解有机物(DOM)转化。结果表明，由于Cl2-氮比在阳极条件下(pH < 1.5)显著低于断裂比，氯化导致的氨损失很小。然而，产生的活性氯诱导了氢提取和饱和键的氯加成，在氨接收溶液中形成了氯化DOM。这需要活性炭后处理以确保产品质量。该电化学系统在390 h内表现出稳定性能，氨去除率为24.4 g-N m-2 h-1，去除/回收效率始终为80%。进一步应关注阴极结垢、阴离子交换膜污染和气体渗透膜润湿的控制。总体而言，该研究表明电化学氨回收技术的适用性有望提高。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及碳材料"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaenm.5c00208","t":"Temperature-Driven Compositional, Morphological, and Crystallographic Evolution of FeCoNiMnCr High-Entropy Alloy Nanoparticles via Flash Joule Heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaenm.5c00208","s":"ACS Applied Engineering Materials","d":"2025-06-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract High-entropy alloys (HEAs), characterized by their multiprincipal elemental compositions and unique core effects (high entropy, severe lattice distortion, sluggish diffusion, and cocktail effects), exhibit exceptional mechanical, catalytic, and functional properties. However, the extreme compositional diversity of HEAs poses significant challenges in achieving tailored materials for targeted applications. Herein, we report a flash Joule heating (FJH)-driven ultrafast synthesis strategy for the controllable fabrication of FeCoNiMnCr HEA nanoparticles (NPs) through a temperature-dependent phase evolution. Systematic modulation of FJH-induced thermal regimes (1300–2000 °C) reveals a critical temperature–composition–structure correlation: phase segregation dominates, yielding irregular Cr NPs, polyhedral MnCr NPs, and spherical FeCoNi NPs with distinct crystallinity at 1300 °C; hete","au":["Hongyu Chen","Tianyu Zhao","Zehui Zhao","Xinyue Miao","Xu Gu","Yi Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"温度驱动的 FeCoNiMnCr 高熵合金纳米颗粒的成分、形貌和晶体学演变（通过闪焦耳热）","zb":"报道了一种闪焦耳热（FJH）驱动的超快合成策略，通过温度依赖的相演变可控地制备 FeCoNiMnCr 高熵合金纳米颗粒（NPs）。系统地调节 FJH 引起的温度范围（1300–2000 °C）揭示了温度-成分-结构的相关性：在 1300 °C 时，相分离占主导地位，产生不规则的 Cr NPs、多面体 MnCr NPs 和球形 FeCoNi NPs，具有不同的结晶度；在 1600 °C 时，出现异质结构 Cr/FeCoNi NPs 和亚稳态 MnCr 多面体；形成均匀的 FeCoNiMnCr 高熵合金 NPs；在 2000 °C 或更高温度下发生结晶到非晶转变。多脉冲 FJH 实验进一步证明了装饰 NPs 以次级相（如 Cu 异质晶体）的能力，实现性能定制。这项工作将 FJH 建立为快速合成高熵合金的通用平台，为非平衡热力学提供了基本见解，并为应用特定的纳米材料设计提供了途径。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1109/ppps56198.2025.11248712","t":"Enhancing Performance of Ru-Ce/AL 2 O 3 for Low Temperatures Ammonia Decomposition to Hydrogen by a Plasma-Assisted Catalyst Preparation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1109/ppps56198.2025.11248712","s":"2025 IEEE Pulsed Power &amp; Plasma Science (PPPS)","d":"2025-06-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Hydrogen $\\left(\\mathrm{H}_{2}\\right)$ production from Ammonia $\\left(\\text{NH}_{3}\\right)$ decomposition is gaining interest, as is a promising green energy source possessing high hydrogen density, and a $\\text{CO}_{\\mathrm{x}}$-free energy source. However, $\\text{NH}_{3}$ decomposition reaction requires high temperatures to achieve high efficiency by catalytic processes. Ruthenium (Ru) is known to be the most efficient metal for low temperatures of $\\text{NH}_{3}$ decomposition and adding Cerium (Ce) as a promoter may further improve its catalytic efficiency. In this study, $\\text{Ru}-\\text{Ce} / \\text{Al}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{3}$ catalyst was prepared by incipient wetness impregnation conjugated with a dielectric barrier discharge plasma (plasma-assisted method); furthermore, for comparison purposes, $\\text{Ru}-\\text{Ce} / \\text{Al}_{2} \\mathrm{O}_{3}$ catalyst was also prepared by only th","au":["D. T. Vo","O. Q. Vu","D. B. Nguyen","Y.S. Mok"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"通过等离子体辅助催化剂制备增强Ru-Ce/Al 2 O 3在低温氨分解制氢的性能","zb":"氢（H2）从氨（NH3）分解制取正日益受到关注，这是一种具有高氢密度和COx无污染能源的绿色能源。然而，氨分解反应需要高温才能通过催化过程实现高效率。钌（Ru）是低温NH3分解的最有效金属，添加铈（Ce）作为助剂可能会进一步提高其催化效率。在本研究中，通过浸渍法结合介电屏障放电等离子体（等离子体辅助方法）制备了Ru-Ce/Al2O3催化剂；此外，为了比较，还通过仅浸渍法（传统方法）制备了Ru-Ce/Al2O3催化剂。结果表明，等离子体辅助方法制备的催化剂提高了NH3分解的催化性能。纯氨气在520°C（WHSV = 5000 mL/gcat⁻¹h⁻¹）下完全分解，而传统方法制备的催化剂需要540°C。同时，在350至500°C的操作温度下，等离子体辅助催化剂的NH3转化率比传统方法制备的催化剂至少高12%。在催化剂制备过程中，表面可能与等离子体相互作用，从而改变其性能，从而提高催化性能。为了","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1109/ppps56198.2025.11248627","t":"Plasma-Electrochemical Synthesis of Ammonia from Air Using a “Cobalt-Nickel Seed Germination” Copper Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1109/ppps56198.2025.11248627","s":"2025 IEEE Pulsed Power &amp; Plasma Science (PPPS)","d":"2025-06-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The electrochemical reduction of N2 for NH3 synthesis presents a sustainable alternative to the Haber-Bosch process, aiming to reduce greenhouse gas emissions and fossil fuel dependency. However, the development of this electrochemical method is hindered by the low solubility and high energy barriers of N2, as well as the limited hydrogen atom dissociation and adsorption efficiency of Cu-based catalysts. In this work, we propose a highly efficient and stable catalyst based on a “seed germination” strategy on a copper-based catalyst to achieve higher concentrations of reactive nitrogen oxide reduction for NH3 synthesis. We employed FIB-SEM technology to investigate the growth behavior of the catalyst across different time scales. Cross-sectional analysis revealed that the thickness of the metal layer increased linearly over time, while the densification of this layer contributed significa","au":["C. Man","C. Zhang","Y. Gao","C. Qi","T. Shao"],"o":"回填","why":["Synthesis of Ammonia"],"zt":"等离子体电化学合成空气中的氨使用“钴-镍种子萌发”铜催化剂","zb":"N2的电化学还原用于NH3合成是哈伯-博施过程的可持续替代方案，旨在减少温室气体排放和化石燃料依赖。然而，这种电化学方法的发展受到N2低溶解度和高能垒的阻碍，以及铜基催化剂的氢原子解离和吸附效率有限的限制。在这项工作中，我们提出了一种基于“种子萌发”策略的高效稳定的催化剂，以在铜基催化剂上实现更高的活性氮氧化物还原浓度，用于NH3合成。我们采用FIB-SEM技术研究了催化剂在不同时间尺度上的生长行为。横截面分析显示，金属层的厚度随时间线性增加，而该层的致密化对催化剂的稳定性有显著贡献。CoNi-Cu2 O2催化剂表现出近100%的氨法拉第效率，在-0.675 V vs. 可逆氢电极（RHE）下产生~3 mmol h cm-2 cat。此外，采用ZDPlaskin的零维动力学模型探索了旋转滑动电弧产生的NOx的产生途径。该研究还深入探讨了CoNi-Cu2 O2催化剂对NOx的有效吸附和转化。","ob":"等离子体制氨｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1109/ppps56198.2025.11248354","t":"Nanosecond Pulsed Plasma for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1109/ppps56198.2025.11248354","s":"2025 IEEE Pulsed Power &amp; Plasma Science (PPPS)","d":"2025-06-15","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Low-temperature plasma technology is a sustainable and promising technology for green and efficient ammonia synthesis at ambient temperature and pressure. This presentation will introduce the nanosecond pulsed plasma for ammonia synthesis in three different aspects. First, the importance of discharge parameters of pulsed plasma source has been evaluated based on the orthogonal experimental method. It was determined that the order of discharge parameters affecting the synthesis rate was: pulse peak voltage > pulse repetition frequency > gas volume ratio > gas total flow rate. The order of discharge parameters affecting the energy yield was: pulse peak voltage > gas volume ratio > pulse repetition frequency > total gas flow rate. Second, the the discharge mode of the nanosecond pulsed gliding arc (GA) plasma has been diagnosed. It can transit from a unipolar state to a bipolar state determ","au":["H. Zhang","X. Xu","Q. Song","J. Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"纳秒脉冲等离子体用于氨合成","zb":"低温等离子体技术是一种可持续且高效的氨合成技术，可在常温常压下进行。本研究介绍了纳秒脉冲等离子体用于氨合成的三个方面。首先，基于正交实验方法评估了脉冲等离子体源放电参数的重要性。确定影响合成速率的放电参数顺序为：脉冲峰值电压 > 脉冲重复频率 > 气体体积比 > 总气体流量。影响能量产率的放电参数顺序为：脉冲峰值电压 > 气体体积比 > 脉冲重复频率 > 总气体流量。其次，诊断了纳秒脉冲滑移电弧（GA）等离子体的放电模式。它可以从单极状态转变为由占空比决定的双极状态，伴随更高的放电功率和振动温度。双极放电模式有利于提高等离子体氨合成的效率，因为它可以增强等离子体放电并提高振动温度。氨合成速率和N2转化率随着放电功率和振动温度的增加而增加。第三，研究了纳秒脉冲介电屏障放电（DBD）和Ni-MOF-74催化剂在以氮和氢为原料的氨合成中的协同效应。在Ni-MOF-74催化剂的存在下，观察到的最高","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动"},{"id":"10.1002/cssc.202500682","t":"Simplified Preparation of BaAl 2 O 4− y e − y /C Oxy‐Electrides Using Pechini Approach for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cssc.202500682","s":"ChemSusChem","d":"2025-06-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Electride‐based materials are among the most active catalysts for ammonia synthesis, with a strong potential for application in the development of green ammonia synthesis; however, their synthesis often requires complicated reaction conditions limiting their scalability. Herein, a straightforward and scalable synthesis method for a BaAl 2 O 4− y e − y /C oxy‐electride composite via carboxylic acid complexation (pseudo‐Pechini) followed by carbothermal reduction is presented. The resulting composite exhibits significant surface area, of ≈41 m 2 g −1 , which is considerably higher than the electrides prepared by solid‐state synthesis. Upon loading with ruthenium, the BaAl 2 O 4− y e − y /C composite demonstrates excellent catalytic activity for ammonia synthesis, achieving rates of 3090 μmol g −1 catal y st h −1 with 0.6Ru/BaAl 2 O 4− y e − y /C, and 3737 μmol g −1 catal y st h −1 with 1.1","au":["Aissam Addou","Amanda Sfeir","Maya Marinova","Hervé Vezin","Jean‐Philippe Dacquin","Sébastien Royer"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"利用Pechini法简化制备用于合成氨的BaAl2O4−y e−y/C氧负离子电子","zb":"采用羧酸络合（伪Pechini）结合碳热还原法，简化制备了比表面积约41 m² g⁻¹的BaAl₂O₄₋y e⁻ᵧ/C氧负离子电子复合材料。负载钌后，该复合材料在400 °C和1 bar条件下表现出优异的催化活性，氨合成速率分别达到3090和3737 μmol g⁻¹ cat h⁻¹。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.5292732","t":"Epitaxial Growth of Pd Nanofilms Using Ethylenediamine Via One-Cell Electrochemical-Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5292732","s":"SSRN","d":"2025-06-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Soojin Kim","Jungjoon Park","Jinmyeong Seo","Soobin Park","Sanghwa Yoon","Bongyoung Yoo"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"使用乙二胺通过单细胞电化学原子层沉积外延生长 Pd 纳米薄膜","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1002/cnma.202500172","t":"Liquid Joule Heating Synthesis of Ultrafine Pd–Se Nanoparticles for Enhanced Oxygen Reduction Electrocatalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/cnma.202500172","s":"ChemNanoMat","d":"2025-06-13","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The development of ultrafast synthesis strategies for nanomaterials is highly attractive for their applications in energy conversion and storage. Herein, a rapid strategy that couples Joule heating with wet chemistry for synthesizing carbon‐supported Pd–Se nanoparticles with an ultrafine size of ≈3.83 nm, which exhibits superior catalytic performance for the oxygen reduction reaction, is demonstrated. In particular, the ultrafine Pd–Se nanoparticles at Pd/Se ratio of 17/15 on the carbon substrate exhibit mass and specific activities of 0.29 A and 0.74 mA cm −2 , respectively, significantly surpassing those of their commercial Pd/C counterparts and a number of Pd‐based electrocatalysts reported recently. This liquid Joule heating (LJH) approach directly applies Joule heating to a liquid mixture of precursors, capping agents, reducing agents, and carbon substrates, enabling simultaneous op","au":["Zhenya Hu","Mengyuan Ma","Dong Chen","Shaonan Tian","Hui Liu","Yu Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"液体焦耳热合成超细 Pd–Se 纳米颗粒以增强氧还原电催化","zb":"展示了一种将焦耳热与湿化学耦合的快速策略，用于合成碳负载的 Pd–Se 纳米颗粒，粒径约为 3.83 nm，表现出优异的氧还原反应催化性能。特别是，在碳载体上 Pd/Se 比为 17/15 的超细 Pd–Se 纳米颗粒的质量和比活性分别为 0.29 A 和 0.74 mA cm −2 ，显著超过其商业 Pd/C 对应物和最近报道的一些 Pd 基电催化剂。这种液体焦耳热（LJH）方法直接将焦耳热应用于前驱体、封端剂、还原剂和碳载体的液体混合物，能够同时优化颗粒尺寸并减少反应时间。这项研究强调了溶剂参与的焦耳热方法在合成针对电催化应用的定制纳米材料方面的潜力。","ob":"通用催化方法｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1007/s10973-025-14354-x","t":"Understanding the role of caesium additive in cobalt catalysts for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s10973-025-14354-x","s":"Journal of Thermal Analysis and Calorimetry","d":"2025-06-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Ammonia (NH3) is the second most produced chemical globally and is one of the largest chemical industries by volume. However, although being well-established, it requires high temperature and pressure conditions, which result in a large energy consumption and carbon dioxide emissions. To address this issue, the development of novel catalysts with high activity under mild reaction conditions has become a prominent area of research. Although the effect of Cs as the promoter for Fe and Ru catalysts has been well described, the effect of Cs doping on the Co catalyst performance in ammonia synthesis has not been well studied yet. Here, we studied the effect of Cs doping on the physicochemical properties and activity of the Co catalysts. It was found that caesium doping was detrimental to the catalytic activity. The ammonia synthesis rate decreased with the increasing amount of caesium added. ","au":["Hubert Ronduda","Magdalena Zybert","Wojciech Patkowski","Małgorzata Lemańska","Andrzej Ostrowski","Kamil Sobczak"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"理解铯添加剂在钴催化剂合成氨中的作用","zb":"研究了铯掺杂对钴催化剂物理化学性质和活性的影响。结果表明铯掺杂对催化活性有害，随着铯添加量增加氨合成速率下降。Cs物种在还原活化过程中不稳定并从表面蒸发，且导致催化剂烧结，造成活性位点不可逆损失。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1039/d5nr01144b","t":"Direct thermal atomic layer deposition of high- κ dielectrics on monolayer MoS 2 : nucleation and growth","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5nr01144b","s":"Nanoscale","d":"2025-06-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Investigation of the nucleation and growth of Al 2 O 3 and HfO 2 films grown directly on chemical vapour-synthesised monolayer MoS 2 via atomic layer deposition.","au":["Brendan F. M. Healy","Sophie L. Pain","Nicholas E. Grant","John D. Murphy"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"在单层 MoS 2 上直接热原子层沉积高-κ 介电材料：成核和生长","zb":"研究了通过原子层沉积在化学气相合成的单层 MoS 2 上生长的 Al 2 O 3 和 HfO 2 薄膜的成核和生长。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c02426","t":"The Synergistic Effect of Combining Electron Transfer and Photoactivation in Hydroxyapatite/ZrO 2 Nanocomposites Promotes Efficient Nitrogen-to-Ammonia Fixation Reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c02426","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2025-06-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Catalytically active hydroxyapatite (ca-HAp) decorated with zirconia nanoparticles (ZrO2 NPs) is presented as a nanocomposite catalyst (ca-HAp/ZrO2) capable of performing highly efficient nitrogen to ammonia (N2-to-NH3) fixation reactions under mild conditions. Accordingly, reactions were carried out in a batch reactor operating at 120 °C, 6 bar of N2, and 20 mL of water, under UV irradiation (14 W) for 72 h. The yield of NH3 obtained was 1.592 ± 0.146 mmol·gc –1, which represents a N2 fixation efficiency of 6.4%. Near ambient pressure X-ray photoelectron spectroscopy (NAP-XPS) studies under in situ conditions (i.e., at elevated pressure and temperature and during UV irradiation) and density functional theory simulations (DFT) allowed us to elucidate the catalytic mechanism of the system. The ca-HAp/ZrO2 nanocomposites exhibit a strong synergy arising from the initial photoactivation of ","au":["Marc Arnau","Lukas Pielsticker","Walid Hetaba","Jordi Casanovas","Pau Turon","Carlos Alemán"],"o":"回填","why":["N2 fixation"],"zt":"羟基磷灰石/ZrO2 纳米复合材料结合电子转移和光活化协同效应促进高效氮气到氨的固定反应","zb":"催化活性羟基磷灰石（ca-HAp）装饰有二氧化锆纳米颗粒（ZrO2 NPs）的纳米复合材料（ca-HAp/ZrO2）作为一种纳米复合材料催化剂，能够在温和条件下执行高效的氮气到氨（N2-to-NH3）固定反应。相应地，反应在120 °C、6 bar的N2和20 mL水的批次反应器中进行，在UV照射（14 W）下持续72小时。获得的NH3产率为1.592 ± 0.146 mmol·gc –1，这代表6.4%的N2固定效率。近环境压力X射线光电子能谱（NAP-XPS）研究在原位条件下（即在升高压力和温度以及UV照射期间）和密度泛函理论模拟（DFT）使我们能够阐明该系统的催化机制。ca-HAp/ZrO2纳米复合材料表现出强烈的协同效应，源于ZrO2通过π-背给机制初始光活化N2（N2被四个Zr4+原子锚定），然后二氮气溢流到Ca(I)2+结合位点。这些位点在ca-HAp的（001）晶体学平面上优","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/aenm.202501526","t":"Plasmon‐Driven Nitrogen Photoreduction to Ammonia Using Silica‐Encapsulated Au Nanostar/TiO 2 Nanohybrids","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/aenm.202501526","s":"Advanced Energy Materials","d":"2025-06-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":10,"ab":"Abstract Plasmon‐induced photocatalysis has gained traction as a promising means to efficiently drive chemical reactions using light. In particular, photocatalytic N 2 reduction emerges as a sustainable route to produce ammonia, a key starting material in the manufacture of nitrogen‐rich fertilizers and a potential energy vector. Here, various Au nanoparticle morphologies combined with a TiO 2 semiconductor are initially screened, and Au nanostar is identified as the most efficient morphology. Encasing this material within a mesoporous silica shell improved their stability and selectivity to ammonia formation, eliminating the need for hole scavengers. Advanced characterization including TEM and operando SERS spectroscopy together with the evaluation of the material in the presence of optical filters and probes reveal that the superior performance originates from the injection of excited ","au":["Yoel Negrín‐Montecelo","Ana Sousa‐Castillo","Noel Cardeñoso‐Garrido","Lucía Guillade","Lucas V. Besteiro","Margarita Vázquez‐González"],"o":"回填","why":["produce ammonia"],"zt":"等离子体驱动氮光还原制氨使用二氧化硅包覆的金纳米星/TiO 2 纳米杂化物","zb":"等离子体诱导光催化作为一种利用光高效驱动化学反应的可持续方法而受到关注。特别是，光催化N2还原已成为生产氨的可持续路线，氨是氮肥制造的关键起始材料，也是一种潜在的能源载体。在这里，最初筛选了各种金纳米粒子形貌与TiO2半导体结合，并确定金纳米星是最有效的形貌。将这种材料包覆在介孔二氧化硅壳内提高了其稳定性和对氨形成的选择性，无需使用空穴清除剂。先进的表征包括TEM和原位SERS光谱，以及评估材料在存在光学滤光器和探针时的性能，表明优异的性能源于等离子体材料中激发的“热”电荷载体的注入，驱动N2还原为NH3在可见光下。波长依赖性实验表明，金介带跃迁和等离子体效应与TiO2半导体的协同作用增强了整个光谱的催化性能。重要的是，等离子体位点产生的热空穴将水氧化为氧气，随后氧化为硝酸盐，以在光催化剂中维持电荷平衡。这种双重功能确保了有效的电荷循环和可持续的多循环性能。","ob":"光催化硝酸盐转化｜光驱动","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsami.5c07123","t":"Electrochemical Nitrogen Fixation Using CeFeO 3 and CeO 2 for Ammonia Synthesis and Nitrate Remediation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsami.5c07123","s":"ACS Applied Materials & Interfaces","d":"2025-06-12","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"In the pursuit of sustainable ammonia synthesis and nitrate remediation, electrochemical nitrate reduction to ammonia (eNO3RR) emerges as a promising alternative to the carbon-intensive Haber–Bosch process, which emits 1.6–2.0 tons of CO2 per ton of ammonia. Powered by renewable energy, the eNO3RR offers reduced emissions and energy consumption but faces challenges in catalytic activity and product selectivity due to its complex mechanism. To address these issues, CeFeO3 supported CeO2 composites were synthesized via a microwave polyol method with varying Ce:Fe atomic ratios and comprehensively characterized. Electrochemical analysis revealed that pure CeO2 achieved a high ammonia yield rate of 4040.5 ± 262.5 μg h–1 cm–2 but with a lower Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 52.8 ± 2.8% at −0.45 VRHE in 0.1 M KOH with 0.1 M NO3 –. Introducing CeFeO3 into CeO2 enhanced FE significantly, reaching a ","au":["James Ebenezer","Parthiban Velayudham","Alex Schechter"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"使用CeFeO 3 和 CeO 2 进行氨合成和硝酸盐修复的电化学氮固定","zb":"在可持续氨合成和硝酸盐修复的追求中，电化学硝酸盐还原至氨（eNO3RR）作为碳密集型哈伯-博施过程的替代方案而备受关注，该过程每生产一吨氨会释放1.6–2.0吨CO2。由可再生能源驱动，eNO3RR提供了减少排放和能耗，但面临催化活性和产物选择性的挑战，由于其复杂机制。为了解决这些问题，通过具有不同Ce:Fe原子比的微波聚醇法合成了CeFeO3负载的CeO2复合材料，并进行了全面表征。电化学分析表明，纯CeO2在−0.45 VRHE的0.1 M KOH和0.1 M NO3⁻中实现了高达4040.5 ± 262.5 μg h–1 cm–2的高氨产率率，但法拉第效率（FE）较低，为52.8 ± 2.8%。引入CeFeO3到CeO2中显著提高了FE，最高达到80.1 ± 3.3%，氨产率为3223.9 ± 168.3 μg h–1 cm–2。副产物氢析出仅占4.9 ± 0.9% FE，而羟胺和亚","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaelm.5c00566","t":"Preparation of BiVO4 Films and Modulation of Their Photocatalytic Properties by Pulsed Laser Deposition, Magnetron Sputtering, and Atomic Layer Deposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaelm.5c00566","s":"ACS Applied Electronic Materials","d":"2025-06-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract With the gradual depletion of fossil fuels and increasing environmental pollution, it is particularly important to find and develop materials and technologies for sustainable clean energy and efficient environmental pollution remediation. Photocatalysis, as a green technology that can utilize the widely available solar energy in nature for energy conversion, pollutant degradation, and chemical preparation, has attracted extensive research. Among them, bismuth vanadate (BiVO4) plays an indispensable role in photocatalytic reactions as a photocatalyst with a narrow band gap, low cost, and good chemical stability. Therefore, this paper provides a detailed overview of the working principles, preparation characteristics, and influencing factors of pulsed laser deposition, magnetron sputtering, and atomic layer deposition technologies that can be used to prepare high-quality BiVO4 fil","au":["Jixiang Cai","Jianguo Wang","Feixing Li","Xueshuai Zhang","Bo Feng","Zecong Yu"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"BiVO4 薄膜的制备及其光催化性能的调制（通过脉冲激光沉积、磁控溅射和原子层沉积）","zb":"概述了可用于制备高质量 BiVO4 薄膜的脉冲激光沉积、磁控溅射和原子层沉积技术的原理、制备特性和影响因素，以及这些方法在调节 BiVO4 薄膜的晶体面工程、元素掺杂、异质结构建和表面改性中的作用。此外，还批判性地讨论了这些三种方法在制备和 BiVO4 薄膜光催化活性释放过程中遇到的主要挑战和对策，为高效、绿色和可持续地开发和应用 BiVO4 薄膜光催化剂在能源开发、环境保护和化学制造领域提供了建设性思路。","ob":"通用催化方法；涉及原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.3390/su17125399","t":"Techno-Economic Analysis of Onsite Sustainable Hydrogen Production via Ammonia Decomposition with Heat Recovery System","u":"https://doi.org/10.3390/su17125399","s":"Sustainability","d":"2025-06-11","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Hydrogen offers a promising solution to reduce emissions in the energy sector with the growing need for decarbonisation. Despite its environmental benefits, the use of hydrogen presents significant challenges in storage and transport. Many studies have focused on the different types of hydrogen production and analysed the pros and cons of each technique for different applications. This study focuses on techno-economic analysis of onsite hydrogen production through ammonia decomposition by utilising the heat from exhaust gas generated by hydrogen-fuelled gas turbines. Aspen Plus simulation software and its economic evaluation system are used. The Siemens Energy SGT-400 gas turbine’s parameters are used as the baseline for the hydrogen gas turbine in this study, together with the economic parameters of the capital expenditure (CAPEX) and operating expenditure (OPEX) are considered. The lev","au":["Jian Tiong Lim","Eddie Yin-Kwee Ng","Hong Xun Ong"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"现场可持续制氢通过氨分解与热回收系统的技术经济分析","zb":"氢气为减少能源部门的排放提供了一个有前景的解决方案，随着脱碳需求的增长。尽管氢气具有环境效益，但氢气的使用在储存和运输方面存在重大挑战。许多研究集中于不同类型的氢气生产，并分析了每种技术在不同应用中的优缺点。本研究侧重于利用氢燃料燃气轮机产生的废热进行氨分解的现场制氢的技术经济分析。使用Aspen Plus模拟软件及其经济评估系统。本研究中使用西门子能源SGT-400燃气轮机的参数作为该研究中氢气燃气轮机的基本参数，同时考虑了资本支出（CAPEX）和运营支出（OPEX）的经济参数。氢气的平准化成本（LCOH）为5.64美元/千克氢气，比传统方法（使用炉子提高氨的温度）低10.6%。LCOH的主要贡献来自氨原料成本高达99%。研究发现氨的价格是LCOH贡献的最敏感参数。本研究的发现表明，使用氨分解通过热回收进行现场制氢并回收氨是经济可行的，并突出了未来进一步降低绿色氨和蓝色氨价格的关键需求。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1080/00295450.2025.2491849","t":"Technoeconomic Assessment of Ammonia Production from Biomass with Nuclear Microreactors","u":"https://doi.org/10.1080/00295450.2025.2491849","s":"Nuclear Technology","d":"2025-06-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"There is rising global interest in ammonia production due to its significant role as a hydrogen carrier and as a critical component in fertilizers. However, the conventional Haber-Bosch (H-B) method, which utilizes fossil fuels, is associated with high energy demand and carbon dioxide emissions. Conversely, the thermochemical conversion of biomass to hydrogen in the ammonia synthesis process is seen as a more sustainable alternative. Innovative nuclear technologies, like microreactors, hold promise as distributed low-carbon energy sources, offering both electricity and process heat. For this process, the energy needs for the thermochemical conversion of biomass to ammonia are evaluated. This paper presents a detailed economic analysis of ammonia production, with a focus on integrating thermal-chemical biomass gasification with a 5-MW(electric) nuclear microreactor as the energy source wi","au":["Ketan Ajay","Jay Gore","Suneet Singh","Hitesh Bindra"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"核微反应器生物质制氨的技术经济评估","zb":"针对传统化石燃料制氨能耗高的问题，研究评估了利用5-MW(electric)核微反应器提供热源，结合热化学生物质气化制氨的技术经济可行性。分析表明，该方法生产的氨平准化成本对核微反应器的资本成本和学习率高度敏感，且比传统的电解结合Haber-Bosch法更便宜。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1021/acsaenm.5c00204","t":"Tailoring Nitrogen Chemistry in Boron- and Nitrogen-Codoped Carbon for Enhanced Electrochemical Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaenm.5c00204","s":"ACS Applied Engineering Materials","d":"2025-06-10","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (eNRR) is a promising sustainable solution for ammonia (NH3) production under ambient conditions. Among different electrocatalytic materials, boron-based nonmetallic systems have been identified as potential electrocatalysts for the eNRR because of the unique ability of boron to mimic transition metal d-orbitals to act as active sites for effective nitrogen activation. However, the influence of the local chemical environment of the active boron site, especially nitrogen doping, on eNRR catalytic behavior has been largely overlooked. In this work, we synthesized a series of boron and nitrogen codoped carbon (BNC) catalysts via high-temperature annealing of polyaniline and boric acid mixtures and systematically examined the impact of nitrogen functionalities and hexagonal boron nitride (h-BN) content on eNRR performance. The electro","au":["Ashida P Hamsa","Mannil Thodi Muhthasin","Sreekuttan M Unni"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过硼和氮共掺杂碳定制氮化学以提高电化学氨合成","zb":"电化学氮还原反应（eNRR）是一种在环境条件下生产氨（NH3）的可持续解决方案。在电催化材料中，基于硼的非金属系统已被确定为eNRR的潜在电催化剂，因为硼具有独特的模仿过渡金属d轨道的能力，以作为有效氮活化的活性位点。然而，活性硼位点的局部化学环境的影响，特别是氮掺杂，对eNRR催化行为的影响在很大程度上被忽视了。在这项工作中，我们通过高温退火聚苯胺和硼酸的混合物合成了一系列硼和氮共掺杂碳（BNC）催化剂，并系统地研究了氮官能团和六方氮化硼（h-BN）含量对eNRR性能的影响。活性硼位点的电子结构和催化行为受到吡啶氮和h-BN的强烈影响，两者都高度依赖于前驱体比例和退火温度。电化学研究表明，由聚苯胺和硼酸以2:1的比例合成并在1000 °C退火的BNC-2–1000催化剂在0.1 M H2SO4中表现出优异的eNRR性能，在-0.2 V vs RHE下，氨产率为23.5 μg h–1 mg","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5nr01169h","t":"Pt atomic cluster-decorated Fe 2 (MoO 4 ) 3 hollow microspheres for detecting sub-parts-per-million xylene prepared by the atomic layer deposition method","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5nr01169h","s":"Nanoscale","d":"2025-06-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"This study employed the atomic layer deposition method to fabricate Pt atomic cluster-decorated Fe 2 (MoO 4 ) 3 hollow microspheres for detecting sub-parts-per-million xylene.","au":["Zhuoyuan Wang","Jiaye Qiu","Jiangmei Gou","Jiangtao Wu","Lei Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积 Pt 原子团簇修饰 Fe2(MoO4)3 中空微球检测 ppm 级二甲苯","zb":"采用原子层沉积方法制备了 Pt 原子团簇修饰的 Fe2(MoO4)3 中空微球，用于检测亚 ppm 级的二甲苯。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Fe/铁体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202510478","t":"Circumventing Scaling Relations via Gradient Orbital Coupling Promotes Ammonia Electrosynthesis on Cobalt Catalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202510478","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-06-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract Highly efficient electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (NH 3 ) relies on the balanced activation of various substrates including nitrate and water, but is currently hindered by the inherent scaling relations governing the adsorption of key reaction intermediates, such as *NO and *H. Herein, we develop a strategy to circumvent these limitations by introducing f–d–p gradient orbital coupling in cobalt oxide (Co 3 O 4 ) through Ce doping. Density functional theory calculations indicate that the lattice strain triggered by the dopant redistributes electron density at the Co and O sites, thereby modulating the adsorption strengths of *NO and *H, which favors the production of NH 3 while suppressing hydrogen evolution reaction. It exhibits a faradaic efficiency of 97.8% and a high yield rate of 3423.0 µg h −1 cm −2 under alkaline conditions. Furthermore, Ce/Co 3 O 4 catalyst s","au":["Hanle Liu","Shunhan Jia","Limin Wu","Ruhan Wang","Libing Zhang","Xinning Song"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"通过梯度轨道耦合绕过比例关系促进钴催化剂上的氨电合成","zb":"高效的电催化硝酸盐还原为氨（NH 3 ）依赖于各种底物的平衡活化，包括硝酸盐和水，但目前受制于控制关键反应中间体（如*NO和*H）吸附的固有比例关系。在此，我们通过Ce掺杂在钴氧化物（Co 3 O 4 ）中引入f-d-p梯度轨道耦合，开发了一种策略来绕过这些限制。密度泛函理论计算表明，掺杂剂的晶格应变重新分配了Co和O位点的电子密度，从而调节了*NO和*H的吸附强度，这有利于NH 3 的生产，同时抑制了析氢反应。在碱性条件下，它表现出97.8%的法拉第效率和3423.0 µg h −1 cm −2 的高产率。此外，Ce/Co 3 O 4 催化剂在从5到200 mM的宽硝酸盐浓度范围内表现出稳健的性能和优异的循环稳定性。我们的研究还表明，梯度轨道耦合方法可以扩展到其他镧系掺杂剂（例如，Pr和Nd），为打破比例关系和提高钴催化剂上NO 3 − ‐to‐NH 3 活性提供了一个广泛适用的平台。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202502708","t":"Open Frameworks Materials for Nitrogen Electrofixation to Ammonia, Progress, Challenges, and Future Perspectives","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202502708","s":"Small","d":"2025-06-09","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract Electrochemical nitrogen reduction (eNRR) offers a sustainable and energy‐efficient alternative to the conventional Haber‐Bosch process for ammonia (NH 3 ) synthesis, operating under mild conditions with reduced environmental impact. Open framework materials (OFMs), encompassing covalent‐organic frameworks (COFs) and metal‐organic frameworks (MOFs), have emerged as highly promising candidates due to their modular structures, tunable porosity, and adaptable functionalities. This review summarizes recent advancements in OFMs for eNRR, focusing on strategies for selection and design of active centers, regulation of porous structure, and conductivity enhancement strategy, as well as surface functionalization and interface engineering. Key challenges, including structural instability, low intrinsic conductivity, and the complexity of scalable synthesis, are critically analyzed. Advan","au":["Shihai Cao","Jingyu Lu","Yuntong Sun","Yinghao Li","Zhendong Hao","Jong‐Min Lee"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"用于氮电固定为氨的开架材料，进展、挑战和未来展望","zb":"电化学氮还原（eNRR）为氨（NH 3 ）合成提供了一种可持续和节能的替代方案，与传统哈伯-博施过程相比，在温和条件下运行，减少环境影响。开架材料（OFMs），包括共价有机框架（COFs）和金属有机框架（MOFs），由于其模块化结构、可调孔隙率和可适应的功能性而成为高度有前景的候选者。本综述总结了OFMs在eNRR方面的最新进展，重点关注活性中心的筛选和设计策略、多孔结构的调控、导电性增强策略，以及表面官能化和界面工程。关键挑战，包括结构不稳定性、低本征导电性和可扩展合成的复杂性，被批判性地分析。提出先进表征方法、理论建模和机器学习作为克服这些障碍的创新工具。最后，讨论了OFMs在可持续NH 3 生产中工业规模应用的潜力，突出了它们在eNRR中的变革性作用。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.202506415","t":"Joule‐Heating Synthesis of High‐Entropy Oxide Nanoparticles as Sulfion Oxidation Catalysts for Efficient and Durable Hybrid Seawater Electrolysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.202506415","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2025-06-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Direct seawater electrolysis for hydrogen production is hindered by high energy consumption and the competing chlorine evolution reaction (CER), which compromises efficiency and generates corrosive byproducts. Replacing oxygen evolution reaction (OER) with sulfion oxidation reaction (SOR) is promising to circumvent CER, but practical applications demand high‐efficiency powdery, supported SOR catalysts operating at high current densities. Herein, we report the synthesis of FeCoNiMnCuO high‐entropy oxide nanoparticles (HEO NPs) supported on carbon through an ultrafast Joule‐heating method, which show outstanding SOR performance in natural seawater, achieving 500 mA cm⁻ 2 at 0.545 V versus the reversible hydrogen electrode and demonstrating stability over 100 h. Operando X‐ray absorption spectroscopy and in‐situ Raman spectroscopy studies reveal that in‐situ formed metal sulfides, ","au":["Weifeng Su","Tao‐Jing Huang","Haoliang Huang","Zhipeng Yu","Fei Lin","Chenyue Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule-Heat"],"zt":"焦耳加热合成高熵氧化物纳米颗粒作为硫离子氧化催化剂用于海水电解","zb":"通过超快焦耳加热法合成了负载于碳上的 FeCoNiMnCuO 高熵氧化物纳米颗粒（HEO NPs）。该催化剂在天然海水中表现出优异的硫离子氧化反应性能，在 500 mA cm⁻² 下达到 0.545 V，并稳定运行 100 小时。原位光谱和密度泛函理论计算表明，高熵效应降低了势控步骤的能量成本。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1002/anie.202509322","t":"Deciphering the N─N Coupling Mechanism Over Iron–Copper Alloy Catalysts During Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/anie.202509322","s":"Angewandte Chemie International Edition","d":"2025-06-05","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Abstract The production of CO x ‐free hydrogen via the ammonia decomposition reaction (ADR) using Fe‐based non‐precious metal catalysts has attracted much attention. N─H bond cleavage and N─N coupling are two key steps in ADR, however, stronger Fe─N binding leads to lower activity of iron catalysts. Herein, we develop FeCu alloy catalysts with optimized metal‐nitrogen binding energy by incorporating Cu, a metal with inherently weaker nitrogen affinity, into Fe‐based catalysts. The optimized Fe 1 Cu 0.5 /MgO catalyst exhibits remarkable catalytic performance, achieving an impressive H 2 production rate of 139.1 mmol H 2 g cat −1 h −1 at 550 °C under a high gas hourly space velocity (GHSV = 360 000 h −1 ). Mechanistic studies reveal that the modulation of the d ‐band structure due to the alloying effect optimizes the dissociation of NH 3 and the binding ability of N* intermediates in the A","au":["Xun Qi","Yu Zhang","Cai Chen","Jiarui Yang","Jie Wen","Zechao Zhuang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"解密铁-铜合金催化剂在氨分解过程中的N─N偶联机制","zb":"通过使用Fe基非贵金属催化剂进行氨分解反应（ADR）生产无CO x 氢气引起了很大关注。N─H键断裂和N─N偶联是ADR的两个关键步骤，然而，更强的Fe─N结合导致铁催化剂的活性较低。在此，我们通过将具有本质上较弱氮亲和力的金属Cu掺入Fe基催化剂中，开发了具有优化金属-氮结合能的铁铜合金催化剂。优化的Fe 1 Cu 0.5 /MgO催化剂表现出卓越的催化性能，在550 °C和高气体小时空速（GHSV = 360 000 h −1 ）下，实现了令人印象深刻的H 2 生产速率139.1 mmol H 2 g cat −1 h −1 。机理研究表明，由于合金化效应引起的d-带结构的调制优化了NH 3 的解离和ADR过程中N*中间体的结合能力。值得注意的是，原位X射线吸收光谱（XAS）结合理论计算证实，铁铜合金化有效地降低了N─N再组合能垒，从2.25 eV（铁簇）降低到1.77 eV（铁铜簇）","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Fe/铁体系","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acs.iecr.5c01156","t":"A Joule Heating-Driven Flow-Through SiC Catalytic Membrane Microreactor for Hydrogen Production from Methanol Steam Reforming","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.iecr.5c01156","s":"Industrial & Engineering Chemistry Research","d":"2025-06-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"A compact and energy-efficient reactor system is essential for advancing hydrogen production technologies based on methanol steam reforming (MSR). However, conventional fixed-bed or externally heated microreactors often suffer from low catalyst utilization, significant heat losses, and poor scalability. In this study, we present a novel flow-through catalytic membrane reactor (CMR) powered by Joule heating in which Cu/ZnO/Al 2 O 3 nanoparticles are immobilized in situ within the microscale pores of a high-thermal-conductivity SiC membrane tube. The system integrates evaporation and reforming zones into a single tube and enables direct internal heating of the catalytic region, minimizing thermal losses and enhancing energy efficiency. Under optimal conditions (300 °C, S/C = 1.5, methanol flow rate = 0.01835 mol min –1 ), the reactor achieved a methanol conversion of 97.55%, a hydrogen vol","au":["Huiyun Huang","Shengchi Bai","Bailin Zhao","Ke Bai","Jingyun Liu","Zeyi Xiao"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"焦耳加热驱动流式 SiC 催化膜微反应器用于甲醇蒸汽重整制氢","zb":"本研究开发了一种由焦耳加热驱动的流过式催化膜微反应器，将Cu/ZnO/Al2O3纳米颗粒原位固定在SiC膜管微孔中。在300 °C、S/C=1.5的优化条件下，该反应器实现了97.55%的甲醇转化率和157.96 kmol m-3 h-1的氢气体积产率，能量效率达98.61%。","ob":"其他催化反应｜反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热"},{"id":"10.1039/d5cc01835h","t":"A TiO 2 /Fe heterostructure enables high-efficiency electrochemical ammonia synthesis from nitrate","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5cc01835h","s":"Chemical Communications","d":"2025-06-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The rational design of heterostructures offers a powerful strategy to enhance the performance towards nitrate (NO3-) reduction to ammonia (NRA). In this work, we successfully constructed a TiO2/Fe heterostructure by anchoring Fe nanoparticles onto TiO2 nanorod arrays, which achieves an impressive Faradaic efficiency of 93.3% and a high NH3 yield rate of 11.96 mg h-1 cm-2. Mechanistic studies reveal that the TiO2/Fe heterostructure effectively enhances NO3- adsorption, facilitates the dissociation of H2O for generating more active hydrogen, and lowers the energy barrier. This work provides valuable insights into the design of advanced heterostructure catalysts for NRA.","au":["Yushuang Gong","Xiaojuan Zhu","Leyang Song","Zehua Wang","Jing Wang","Xiang Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"一个 TiO 2 /Fe 异质结构能够实现从硝酸盐到氨的高效电化学合成","zb":"研究对象为 TiO2/Fe 异质结构，通过将 Fe 纳米颗粒锚定在 TiO2 纳米棒阵列上制备，用于硝酸盐 (NO3-) 还原为氨 (NRA)。关键方法是构建异质结构并采用电化学方法进行表征，主要结果是在 -0.1 V vs RHE 下，Faradaic 效率为 97.3%，氨产率为 4.01 mg h-1 cm-2。理论研究表明，Ag-Ni(OH)2/Cu NW 异质结构的优异性能源于多位点协同的级联电催化，其中 Ag 和 Ni(OH)2 物种分别促进 NO3- 还原为 NO2- 和 H2O 分解产生 *H，Ni(OH)2/Cu 界面加速 NO2- 还原为 NH3。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-2s260","t":"India’s Ammonia Industry: Balancing Growth with Sustainability","u":"https://doi.org/10.26434/chemrxiv-2025-2s260","s":"ChemRxiv","d":"2025-06-04","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"India, due to its agriculture-intensive economy, is a large consumer of nitrogen fertilisers. India’s domestic ammonia manufacturing capacity is about 19 MMT today. The expansion of India’s economy and the growing per capita income are likely to increase the demand for food grains, which in turn, will increase the demand for ammonia. This study explores the growth of Indian ammonia production capacity on a decadal time scale, 2030-2070. The scope 1 and 2 emission intensities of India’s ammonia production are estimated using a Life Cycle Assessment (LCA) approach under a business-as-usual (BAU) scenario. It is found that total emissions from ammonia manufacturing in India are likely to increase from 145 MMT in 2030 to about 540 MMT by 2070 without any abatement. Several technology interventions for emission reduction have been considered, and their impact on emission reduction has been es","au":["Triya Mukherjee","Harishankar Kopperi","Poonam Kumari","Yamini Javvadi","Ranaprathap Katakojwala","S Venkata Mohan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/acscatal.5c01332","t":"Tuning the Electronic Structure of BaAl 2 O 4– x A y with Anion Substitution for Cobalt-Loaded Ammonia Synthesis Catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acscatal.5c01332","s":"ACS Catalysis","d":"2025-06-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":40,"ab":"High Resolution Image Download MS PowerPoint Slide Mixed-anion materials that contain H – and N 3– have been reported as capable of activating transition metal catalysts and achieving high performance in ammonia synthesis. However, the dominant effect of these anions remains unclear due to the complicated situation that arises from facile surface anion exchange and the changeable valence states of the metal cations under reaction conditions. This study advances the understanding of the anion effect on the catalytic performance through evaluation of the electronic structure of mixed-anion oxynitride and oxyhydride materials, BaAl 2 O 4– x A y (A = N or H). Anionic electrons are generated in the crystallographic cages of BaAl 2 O 4 accompanied by H – substitution and midgap states are formed at a much shallower energy level above the original valence band minimum (VBM). These anionic elect","au":["Yihao Jiang","Shiyao Wang","Masayoshi Miyazaki","Kaito Niita","Jiang Li","Hideo Hosono"],"o":"回填","w":["Hideo Hosono"],"why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"通过阴离子取代调控 BaAl2O4-xAy 的电子结构以负载钴用于氨合成","zb":"通过评估BaAl2O4–xAy（A=N或H）混合阴离子氧氮化物和氧氢化物的电子结构，研究阴离子效应。研究发现H-取代产生阴离子电子，形成浅能级中间态，降低功函数，增强电子给体能力促进Co上的N2解离；而N-取代无此效应，氮空位成为活性位点。","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsaenm.5c00112","t":"Leveraging Electron Transfer in Trimetal-Loaded CeGdO Support for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsaenm.5c00112","s":"ACS Applied Engineering Materials","d":"2025-06-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"Abstract We report the activity of transition metals (Fe, Co, and Ru) supported on CeO2 (CeO) and Gd-doped CeO2 (CeGdO) for ammonia synthesis. Compared with BM/CeO (BM = Fe + Co), the Ru/BM/CeGdO catalyst achieved 3.1-fold higher rates at 450 °C and 0.8 MPa. Such high activity was attributed to the basicity of the catalysts and their reversible hydrogen storage ability. Specifically, built-in oxygen vacancies and partially reduced ceria support readily transfer electrons to the metals. Further, the electron-rich metal surface easily dissociates N2 and forms NH3 at rapid rates. Kinetic analysis indicates the positive hydrogen order for Ru/BM/CeGdO, which indicates the mitigation of the hydrogen poisoning effect and shift of the rate-determining step from nitrogen dissociation to NHx formation. These catalysts demonstrate stable performance for long durations. This work highlights the pote","au":["Pintu Kumar Roy","Sai Sundara Sandeep Ganti","Shyam Kishore Choudhary","Sushant Kumar"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"利用电子转移增强三金属负载CeGdO载体的氨合成活性","zb":"研究报道了负载Fe、Co和Ru的三种过渡金属催化剂在450 °C和0.8 MPa下的氨合成活性。结果表明，Ru/BM/CeGdO催化剂的活性是BM/CeO的3.1倍，归因于CeGdO载体中的氧空位和部分还原态能向金属转移电子，促进了N2解离和NH3快速形成。动力学分析显示该催化剂具有正氢级数，表明氢中毒效应得到缓解。","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系"},{"id":"10.1039/d5ee01509j","t":"Upcycling waste photovoltaic cells into silicon carbide via flash Joule heating","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5ee01509j","s":"Energy & Environmental Science","d":"2025-06-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":22,"ab":"Flash Joule heating rapidly converts waste silicon solar cells into high purity SiC at ∼2200 °C, offering a low-emission, energy-efficient, and cost-effective route for sustainable PV waste upcycling.","au":["Ximing Zhang","Feihong Guo","Xiaoxiang Jiang","Abdullah H. Hamadamin","Adam F. Lee","Karen Wilson"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"利用闪焦耳加热将废弃光伏电池升级为碳化硅","zb":"利用闪焦耳加热技术，在约2200 °C下将废弃硅太阳能电池转化为高纯度SiC，提供了一种低排放、节能且经济的可持续光伏废料升级回收途径。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控｜焦耳热用于制备","top":1},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.5c02072","t":"Room-Temperature Catalyst-Free Ammonia Decomposition for Hydrogen Production on Water Microdroplets","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c02072","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2025-06-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"Ammonia has been considered a viable carbon-free hydrogen carrier, yet its decomposition to hydrogen mainly relies on noble-metal-based catalysts and high temperatures. Here, through leveraging extraordinary physicochemical properties at the gas-liquid interface of water microdroplets, we present a catalyst-free and scalable approach for hydrogen production from ammonia under ambient conditions. A maximum hydrogen evolution rate of 226.8 μmol/h was observed, which outperformed most conventional catalytic methods at room temperature. Comprehensive experimental investigations and theoretical calculations revealed the underlying ammonia splitting mechanisms: hydroxyl radical and hydrogen radical, generated at the gas-liquid interface of microdroplets, synergistically triggered the interfacial ammonia decomposition following a thermodynamically favorable redox pathway, and the reaction rates","au":["Kejian Li","Bingxing Zhang","Deming Xia","Zhengwei Ye","Yuyang Pan","Joseph S. Francisco"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"室温无催化剂氨分解用于水微液滴上氢气生产","zb":"研究对象为水微液滴界面处的氨分解反应，通过利用微液滴的物理化学性质制备，用于氢气生产。关键方法是利用微液滴界面进行实验和理论计算，主要结果是在室温下观察到最大氢气产率为 226.8 μmol/h，优于大多数传统催化方法。实验和理论研究表明，羟基自由基和氢自由基在微液滴界面处生成，协同触发界面氨分解，遵循热力学上有利的热氧化还原途径。","ob":"氨分解制氢｜电场辅助，未证实焦耳供热","top":1},{"id":"10.37394/232015.2025.21.53","t":"Techno-economic Analysis of Green Methanol and Ammonia Production in Turkey","u":"https://doi.org/10.37394/232015.2025.21.53","s":"WSEAS TRANSACTIONS ON ENVIRONMENT AND DEVELOPMENT","d":"2025-06-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"This research examines two distinct power-to-fuel approaches for the sustainable synthesis of fuels (green methanol and green ammonia), considering their energetic and economic implications. Both methods involve a 10 MW alkaline electrolysis unit powered by renewable wind energy to generate high-purity green hydrogen. Subsequently, the study explores two processes for synthesizing two specific chemicals with market prices in Türkiye. In the initial scenario, hydrogen is combined with CO2, sourced from an industrial facility, and captured by a biogas plant. The resulting gases are directed to a pressurized reactor for methanol synthesis. In the second scenario, hydrogen is mixed with N2 obtained from an industrial air separation unit (ASU), and the mixture is sent to a reactor for ammonia synthesis. Both synthesis processes are conducted under elevated pressures and temperatures. The econ","au":["Kadi̇r Aydin","Alkim Aydin"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"绿色甲醇和氨生产在土耳其的技术经济分析","zb":"这项研究考察了两种不同的功率到燃料方法，用于可持续合成燃料（绿色甲醇和绿色氨），考虑了它们的能量和经济影响。两种方法都涉及一个由可再生风能供电的10 MW碱性电解槽，用于产生高纯度的绿色氢气。随后，该研究探索了两种合成两种特定化学品（在土耳其市场价格）的过程。在初始场景中，氢气与来自一个工业设施的CO2结合，并由一个沼气厂捕获。产生的气体被引导到一个加压反应器中进行甲醇合成。在第二种场景中，氢气与来自一个工业空气分离单元（ASU）的N2混合，混合物被送到一个用于氨合成的反应器中。两种合成过程都在升高的压力和温度下进行。在两种情况下，都评估了功率到燃料植物的经济可行性。甲醇合成与氨生产相比表现出略高的效率，但两种解决方案显示出相似的经济影响。通过出售主要的副产品氧气，两种情况的经济可持续性得到进一步增强。这方面，以及预计的电解槽资本成本的降低，被证明对于实现经济可持续性至关重要。"},{"id":"10.1039/d5cy00496a","t":"Modulating the alkalinity of molten chloride salt with proton sources for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1039/d5cy00496a","s":"Catalysis Science & Technology","d":"2025-06-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia is synthesized via a stepwise cycle comprising molten LiCl electrolysis, N 2 fixation with metallic lithium, and HCl addition as an effective proton source.","au":["Bingxu Xi","Jian Liu","Bo Yang","Xiaofei Guan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"通过质子源调节熔融氯化盐的碱度用于氨合成","zb":"研究对象为熔融 LiCl 电解、金属锂固氮和 HCl 作为有效质子源的氨合成步骤循环。"},{"id":"10.1021/acsmaterialslett.5c00366","t":"Exploring Atomic-Scale Interactions at the Interface of Reducible Oxide and Ruthenium Nanocatalyst for Ammonia Decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsmaterialslett.5c00366","s":"ACS Materials Letters","d":"2025-06-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Reconstructing interfaces at the atomic level through interactions between precious metal catalysts and highly stable oxides opens new possibilities for enhancing inherent catalytic properties. Here, we investigate the interactions between metal oxide particles and Ru nanoparticles formed through the pyrolysis of metal-organic frameworks (MOFs) composed of oxide clusters with varying reducibility, accompanied by Ru precursor ions in an oxygen-suppressed, high-temperature environment. This study utilizes the ammonia decomposition reaction as a probe to examine these interactions. Despite having an ideal size of 2.3 nm for ammonia decomposition, Ru nanoparticles interacting strongly with reducible CeO2 nanoparticles exhibit relatively low conversion rates. Post-catalysis, X-ray absorption spectroscopy (XAS) analysis reveals changes at the interface between CeO2 and Ru particles, shedding l","au":["Mansu Kim","Hyuk Choi","Jonghwan Park","Jian Liu","Sohui Kim","Kunmo Koo"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Decomposition"],"zt":"探索可还原氧化物和钌纳米催化剂界面处的原子级相互作用以用于氨分解","zb":"研究对象为可还原氧化物颗粒和 Ru 纳米颗粒之间的相互作用，通过金属有机框架 (MOFs) 的热解制备，用于氨分解反应。关键方法是利用氨分解反应作为探针，采用 X 射线吸收光谱 (XAS) 进行表征，主要结果是在 2.3 nm 的理想尺寸下，与可还原 CeO2 纳米颗粒强相互作用的 Ru 纳米颗粒表现出相对较低的转化率。","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Ru/钌体系"},{"id":"10.1021/acs.nanolett.5c02281","t":"Ag-Ni(OH) 2 /Cu Heterostructure for Tandem Electrocatalytic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia Coupled with 5-Hydroxymethylfurfural Electrooxidation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.nanolett.5c02281","s":"Nano Letters","d":"2025-06-03","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Electrochemical reduction of nitrate ions to NH3 provides a sustainable route for both NH3 synthesis and wastewater treatment, but it remains challenging. Here we report a Ag-Ni(OH)2/Cu NW heterostructure that exhibits a high NH3 Faraday efficiency of 97.3% with an NH3 yield rate of 4.01 mg h-1 cm-2 at -0.1 V vs RHE. Theoretical studies reveal that the excellent performance of Ag-Ni(OH)2/Cu NW results from the multisite synergy via a cascade electrocatalysis, in which Ag and Ni(OH)2 species promote NO3- reduction to NO2- and H2O dissociation to generate *H, respectively, and Ni(OH)2/Cu interface accelerates NO2- reduction to NH3. Meanwhile, using Ag-Ni(OH)2/Cu NW as both the anode and cathode, a two-electrode system integrating the nitrate reduction reaction with the 5-hydroxymethylfurfural oxidation reaction achieves 98.1% NH3 Faraday efficiency with a 3.17 mg h-1 cm-2 NH3 yield rate an","au":["Xue Chen","Yuexuan He","Guopeng Ding","Zixuan Feng","Qianling Wei","Chunyu Sui"],"o":"回填","why":["NH3 synthesis"],"zt":"Ag-Ni(OH) 2 /Cu 异质结构用于串联电催化硝酸盐还原为氨与 5-羟甲基糠醛电氧化","zb":"研究对象为 Ag-Ni(OH)2/Cu NW 异质结构，通过电化学方法制备，用于硝酸盐还原为氨 (NRA) 和 5-羟甲基糠醛电氧化。关键方法是构建异质结构并采用电化学方法进行表征，主要结果是在 -0.1 V vs RHE 下，Faradaic 效率为 97.3%，氨产率为 4.01 mg h-1 cm-2。理论研究表明，Ag-Ni(OH)2/Cu NW 异质结构的优异性能源于多位点协同的级联电催化，其中 Ag 和 Ni(OH)2 物种分别促进 NO3- 还原为 NO2- 和 H2O 分解产生 *H，Ni(OH)2/Cu 界面加速 NO2- 还原为 NH3。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1088/2631-8695/addb0f","t":"Synthesis of reduced graphene-based nickel oxide hybrid material for ammonia sensing","u":"https://doi.org/10.1088/2631-8695/addb0f","s":"Engineering Research Express","d":"2025-06-03","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"Abstract The reduced graphene oxide (rGO)-based nickel oxide (NiO) hybrid material holds significant potential for advancing ammonia sensing technology due to its synergistic properties, enabling high sensitivity, selectivity, and rapid response. In this study, rGO-based nickel oxide hybrid materials were hydrothermally synthesized with varying concentrations of rGO (5 wt%, 10 wt%, and 15 wt%) to evaluate their response to ammonia gas exposure. The as-synthesized hybrid structures were characterized using x-ray diffraction (XRD), field emission scanning electron microscopy (FE-SEM), and energy-dispersive x-ray spectroscopy (EDS) to determine their crystalline structure, morphology, and elemental composition. Diffuse reflectance spectroscopy (DRS) revealed that increasing the graphene content decreased the bandgap to 3.18 eV for 15 wt% of rGO, compared to NiO’s bandgap of 3.6 eV. X-ray ph","au":["Fatima Mehmood","Sofia Siddique","Abdul Shakoor","Javed Hussain","Gul Naz","Saqlain A Shah"],"o":"回填","zt":"基于还原氧化石墨烯的镍氧化物混合材料的合成及其在氨传感中的应用","zb":"研究对象为rGO基镍氧化物混合材料，采用水热法合成不同rGO含量的样品（5 wt%、10 wt%、15 wt%），并使用XRD、FE-SEM、EDS、DRS、XPS和四探针IV分析进行表征。结果显示，随着rGO含量增加，带隙减小，15 wt% rGO的带隙为3.18 eV。纯NiO在接触氨气后电流从400 nA增加到1 mA，电阻从250 MΩ降至1 kΩ；而15 wt% rGO混合材料的电流和电阻变化分别为16 μA到19 mA和62.5 kΩ到52.6 Ω，表现出更优的传感性能。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）；涉及Fe/铁体系、碳材料"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202503970","t":"Metal‐Organic Frameworks and Composites for Ammonia Capture","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202503970","s":"Small","d":"2025-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":25,"ab":"Abstract The Haber‐Bosch process has fueled surging ammonia (NH 3 ) demand for agriculture, pharmaceuticals, and energy, but its toxic, corrosive nature poses challenges for high‐pressure storage and transport. Research on metal‐organic frameworks (MOFs) for NH 3 storage emphasizes their exceptional porosity and functionalization capabilities, enabling high adsorption capacities However, their stability remains a challenge, as many degrade upon NH 3 exposure. Recent efforts aim to enhance both NH 3 uptake and stability through improved synthesis and post‐synthetic modifications. This review highlights recent advances in MOFs for NH 3 adsorption, focusing on the key mechanisms involving open metal sites, µ‐OH groups, structural defects, and functional surface modifications. The incorporation of unsaturated metal sites and Brønsted acidic µ‐OH groups significantly improves NH 3 binding, wh","au":["Jintu Francis Kurisingal","Namju Kim","Dae Won Kim","Hongryeol Yun","Chang Seop Hong"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"用于氨捕获的金属有机框架及复合材料","zb":"综述了金属有机框架在氨捕获方面的最新进展，重点探讨了开放金属位点、µ-OH基团、结构缺陷和表面功能化等关键机制。文章指出，引入不饱和金属位点和布朗斯特酸性µ-OH基团能显著提高氨结合力，而缺陷工程和功能化修饰（如阴离子插入和羟基化）则能提升吸附容量。此外，金属卤化物嵌入和离子液体负载的MOF复合材料表现出优异的协同捕获性能。","ob":"N₂/H₂气相合成氨"},{"id":"10.1109/iitc66087.2025.11075510","t":"Plasma-Enhanced Atomic Layer Deposition of Yttrium Carbide Thin Films as a Promising Transition Metal Carbide for Dual Diffusion Barrier in Cu and Ru Metallization","u":"https://doi.org/10.1109/iitc66087.2025.11075510","s":"2025 IEEE International Interconnect Technology Conference (IITC)","d":"2025-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Transition metal carbides (TMCs) possess superior properties compared to transition metal nitrides (TMNs). However, despite their advantages, atomic layer deposition (ALD) and plasma-enhanced ALD (PEALD) techniques for these materials, particularly yttrium carbide (YCx), have not been thoroughly investigated. This study introduces a PEALD approach for fabricating high-quality YCxthin films with excellent uniformity and precise thickness control. With a focus on their potential as advanced diffusion barriers, the research employs a metal-organic Y precursor in combination with H2plasma to produce highly crystalline, low-resistivity YCxfilms. To refine the deposition process, critical parameters such as temperature (ranging from 150 °C to 350 °C), precursor pulse time, and plasma exposure duration were carefully optimized. Under these conditions, the film exhibited a growth rate of ~0.13 n","au":["Minjeong Kweon","Chaehyun Park","Debananda Mohapatra","Sang Bok Kim","Jong-Seong Bae","Taehoon Cheon"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"钇碳化物薄膜的等离子体增强原子层沉积及其在Cu和Ru金属化中的双扩散阻挡性能","zb":"本研究采用等离子体增强原子层沉积（PEALD）技术，利用金属有机钇前驱体结合H2等离子体制备了高质量、低电阻率的YCx薄膜。该薄膜在250 °C下生长速率约0.13 nm/cycle，具有95%的深宽比约1.5的沟槽结构覆盖率和4.63 g/cm3的密度。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1109/iitc66087.2025.11075358","t":"Temperature-Dependent ALD and Quasi-ALE Behavior of Ruthenium Thin Films","u":"https://doi.org/10.1109/iitc66087.2025.11075358","s":"2025 IEEE International Interconnect Technology Conference (IITC)","d":"2025-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"The precise control of deposition and etching processes is essential for integrating Ruthenium (Ru) as a potential copper (Cu) replacement in advanced interconnect technology. In this study, atomic layer deposition (ALD) Ru films were deposited at various temperatures, and their etching behavior in quasi-atomic layer etching (ALE) was investigated. The quasi-ALE process was conducted through adsorption (oxidation), desorption (removal), and reduction steps to achieve controlled Ru etching. The relationship between deposition conditions and etching characteristics was analyzed to understand the quasi-self-limiting behavior of the process. This study provides insights into optimizing oxidation and reduction conditions for a more stable and uniform ALE process, contributing to the development of Ru-based interconnects.","au":["Youngseo Na","Hyunjin Lim","Sangkuk Han","Hyojin Ahn","Yehbeen Im","Kangbaek Seo"],"o":"回填","why":["atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"铱薄膜的温度依赖性ALD与准ALE行为","zb":"为评估钌作为铜替代材料在先进互连技术中的应用，本研究研究了不同温度下原子层沉积钌薄膜的准原子层刻蚀行为。通过吸附（氧化）、脱附（去除）和还原步骤实现可控刻蚀，分析了沉积条件与刻蚀特性的关系，为优化氧化和还原条件提供了见解。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及Ru/钌体系、原子层沉积"},{"id":"10.1002/smll.202503335","t":"Flash Joule Heating Synthesis of Nitrogen‐Rich Defective G‐C₃N₄ for Highly Efficient Photocatalytic Hydrogen Evolution","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/smll.202503335","s":"Small","d":"2025-06-02","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Abstract Seeking renewable energy solutions that are sustainable and environmentally friendly is a critical contemporary research imperative. This paper presents a flash Joule heating approach to prepare high‐performance nitrogen‐rich defective graphitic carbon nitride (g‐C₃N₄) for hydrogen production by photocatalytic water splitting at ultralow cost. By leveraging the rapid heating and cooling capabilities of flash Joule heating, and using melamine as the sole precursor, defects are introduced and precisely regulated while preserving the structural integrity of as‐synthesized prepared g‐C₃N₄. By tuning the processing parameters, the band structure of g‐C₃N₄ can also be optimized, which can significantly suppress electron‐hole recombination and substantially enhance its photocatalytic hydrogen evolution from splitting water. As a result, a hydrogen evolution rate of 16936.5 µmol h⁻¹ g⁻¹","au":["Jiawei Xiao","Yun Chen","Chuhao Cai","Shengbao Lai","Liang Cheng","Junjie Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule Heat"],"zt":"闪焦耳加热合成富氮缺陷g-C₃N₄用于高效光催化析氢","zb":"利用闪焦耳加热法以三聚氰胺为前驱体合成富氮缺陷石墨相氮化碳，通过调控工艺参数优化能带结构以抑制载流子复合，所得Pt/g-C₃N₄析氢速率达16936.5 µmol h⁻¹ g⁻¹。","ob":"析氢反应；涉及碳材料｜焦耳热用于制备"},{"id":"10.1021/jacs.5c00551","t":"Lithium-Mediated Ammonia Electrosynthesis over Orderly Arranged Dipoles Regulated Solid-Electrolyte Interphase","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/jacs.5c00551","s":"Journal of the American Chemical Society","d":"2025-06-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":13,"ab":"The electrocatalytic lithium-mediated nitrogen reduction reaction (Li-NRR) is considered as a promising alternative to the energy-intensive Haber-Bosch route. However, the solid electrolyte interphase that is derived from the electrolyte easily hinders the diffusion and nucleation of Li+, which ultimately suppresses N2 activation and the subsequent protonation process. Herein, we successfully construct surface oxygen vacancies (Ov) on commercial BaTiO3 (BTO) nanoparticles and further drive the phase transition from cubic/tetragonal to rhombohedral, which enhances the ferroelectricity of Ov-enriched BaTiO3 (BTOV) and produces orderly arranged dipoles. Systematic experimental and computational results validate that Ov-induced orderly arranged dipoles readily bind anions in the electrolyte and promote their reduction to form a LiF-rich SEI. The optimized anion-derived SEI enhances the Li+ t","au":["Fangying Duan","Junwu Chen","Mengfei Zhang","Yiming Liu","Hao Xue","Yu Sun"],"o":"回填","why":["Haber-Bosch"],"zt":"在有序排列的偶极调控的固体电解质界面上的锂介导的氨电合成","zb":"研究对象为有序排列的偶极调控的固体电解质界面（SEI），通过在BaTiO3（BTO）纳米颗粒上构建表面氧空位（Ov）并驱动相变，增强Ov富集BaTiO3（BTOV）的铁电性。BTOV表面产生的有序偶极促进电解质阴离子的还原，形成富含LiF的SEI，提高Li+传输动力学和均匀成核，从而提升Li-NRR性能。BTOV在-0.5 V下实现93.01%的法拉第效率和6.94 nmol s-1 cm-2的氨产率，比BTO提高45倍以上。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","top":1},{"id":"10.2139/ssrn.5279438","t":"Efficient Electrosynthesis of Ammonia from Nitrate Reduction Over the Perylene Diimide-Based Heterostructure","u":"https://doi.org/10.2139/ssrn.5279438","s":"SSRN","d":"2025-06-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Hongjun Fang","Fang Fang","Hongsheng Yang","Xinzhen Feng","Weijie Ji","Chak-Tong Au"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesis of Ammonia"],"zt":"基于蒽醌二亚胺基异质结构的硝酸根还原高效电合成氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1,"pre":1},{"id":"10.1021/acsanm.5c02525","t":"CuInSe 2 Quantum Dots Embedded in Bi 2 WO 6 Nanosheets for Electrocatalytic Nitrogen Reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1021/acsanm.5c02525","s":"ACS Applied Nano Materials","d":"2025-06-02","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"For hundreds of years, ammonia has been an important raw material for industrial production worldwide. At present, the electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) has become a very attractive and promising method for NH 3 synthesis. But due to the high bond energy and strong dipole moment of the N≡N bond in nitrogen gas, it is extremely difficult to decompose. At normal temperature and pressure, the reaction kinetics of the NRR is still relatively slow. Herein, CuInSe 2 quantum dots (CuInSe 2 -QDs) are highly dispersed on the surface of Bi 2 WO 6 nanosheets to form p–n heterojunctions, which can effectively increase the reaction rate of NRR. As a result, CuInSe 2 QDs-Bi 2 WO 6 exhibit a high yield rate of 36.1 μg h –1 mg cat –1 and NH 3 Faradaic efficiency of 9.3%, which is superior to the pristine Bi 2 WO 6 (9.1 μg h –1 mg cat –1 5.1%) under neutral solution. CuInSe 2 QDs-Bi 2 WO","au":["Yuanming Mu","Qiang Hu","Yuyao Ji","Xingquan Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"Bi 2 WO 6 纳米片嵌入的CuInSe 2 量子点用于电催化氮还原","zb":"研究对象为CuInSe 2 量子点（CuInSe 2 -QDs）负载Bi 2 WO 6 纳米片形成的p-n异质结，用于电催化氮还原反应（NRR）。CuInSe 2 -QDs-Bi 2 WO 6 在中性溶液中表现出36.1 μg h –1 mg cat –1的产率率和9.3%的法拉第效率，优于原始Bi 2 WO 6（9.1 μg h –1 mg cat –1和5.1%）。该材料具有良好的电化学稳定性，为设计NRR催化剂提供了新思路。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1063/1674-0068/cjcp2404064","t":"Revisiting active sites for nitrogen reduction reaction on 2D materials supported metal atoms: A theoretical investigation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1063/1674-0068/cjcp2404064","s":"Chinese Journal of Chemical Physics","d":"2025-06-01","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Single atom catalysts supported by two-dimensional (2D) materials, including graphene, g-C3N4, and graphdiyne, exhibit promising electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction reaction (NRR) activity. Nevertheless, sometimes theoretical works failed to predict the high activity of NRR of single atom catalysts, especially for Fe, Co, Mn, Cu, Ru. In this work, based on DFT calculations, it is suggested that dual-atom sites on N doped graphene (M2@N-graphene) rather than single-atom sites are more likely to be the active sites for NRR. Notably, Fe2@N3, Co2@N2, Mn2@N2, Cu2@N1, and Ru2@N3 endow the best catalytic activity with corresponding limiting potentials of −0.26, −0.18, −0.17, −0.39, and −0.30 V, respectively. Furthermore, on g-C3N4 and graphdiyne, triple-atom sites (TAS, M3) such as Ru3(Co3)@g-C3N4 and Ru3(Rh3)@graphdiyne are expected to exhibit higher stability and NRR catalytic performance tha","au":["Mingxin Qin","Wenhua Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"二维材料负载金属原子氮还原反应活性位的再审视：理论研究","zb":"研究对象为二维材料（包括石墨烯、g-C3N4、图二炔）负载的单原子催化剂，通过DFT计算发现N掺杂石墨烯上的双原子位（M2@N-graphene）而非单原子位是NRR的活性位。Fe2@N3、Co2@N2、Mn2@N2、Cu2@N1和Ru2@N3分别具有-0.26、-0.18、-0.17、-0.39、-0.30 V的极限电位。此外，g-C3N4和图二炔上的三原子位（M3）如Ru3(Co3)@g-C3N4和Ru3(Rh3)@graphdiyne表现出比单原子位和双原子位更高的稳定性和催化性能。计算结果与实验电位一致，表明M2或M3是实验中观察到的高活性NRR位点的来源。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Ru/钌体系、Fe/铁体系、碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ces.2025.121676","t":"Coupling metal and support clusters dictates the reactivity of Ru catalysts for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ces.2025.121676","s":"Chemical Engineering Science","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":36,"ab":"","au":["Tianhua Zhang","Yangyu Zhang","Zuo-Chang Chen","Yujue Qiu","Mingyuan Zhang","Shiyong Zhang"],"o":"回填","w":["Lilong Jiang"],"why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"耦合金属和载体团簇决定 Ru 催化剂合成氨的反应性","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2024.130829","t":"High Activity of Nickel-Promoted Mn4n in Chemical Looping Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2024.130829","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Qiuyan Xue","Tuo Guo","Ziheng Han","Zhuxian Gao","Jingjing Ma","Xiude Hu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"化学循环氨合成中 Mn4n 的镍促进高活性","ob":"化学链/晶格氮循环制氨","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.checat.2025.101426","t":"Computational modeling of a high-entropy alloy for enhanced ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.checat.2025.101426","s":"Chem Catalysis","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Julia H. Baratta","Andrew S. Rosen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"高熵合金增强氨合成计算的建模","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.checat.2025.101425","t":"Decoupling electron transfer and N2 activation in sodium-mediated cascade for ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.checat.2025.101425","s":"Chem Catalysis","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Zuxin Wen","Yixin Chen","Xianbiao Fu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"解耦钠介导级联反应中的电子转移和 N2 活化","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125106","t":"Enhancing nitrogen-to-ammonia electrofixation via N₂ expulsion by squeezing water molecular network with kosmotropic chemistry","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125106","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"direct","sc":28,"ab":"","au":["Jiajia Zhang","Zhi Zhong Ang","Li Shiuan Ng","Carice Chong","Siew Kheng Boong","Haitao Li"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen-to-ammonia"],"zt":"通过 kosmotropic 化学挤压水分子网络增强氮气电固定为氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.nanoen.2025.110843","t":"Coupling layered spraying with Joule heating to achieve efficient CuZn alloy synthesis for self-powered nitrate reduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.nanoen.2025.110843","s":"Nano Energy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3","joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":21,"ab":"","au":["Shuaitong Wang","Yang Liu","Jinrui Huang","Shizhe Liu","Shilong Li","Mengran Liu"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction","Joule heat"],"zt":"耦合层状喷涂与焦耳加热实现高效CuZn合金合成用于自驱动硝酸盐还原为氨","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.rineng.2025.105164","t":"Magneto-bioconvective flow of ferromagnetic nanoparticles containing joule heating and gyrotactic microorganisms phenomenon","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.rineng.2025.105164","s":"Results in Engineering","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"• Magneto-bioconvection analysis for Carreau fluid is securitized here. • Impact of Brownian moment of ferromagnetic nanoparticles on heat transfer analysis is investigated. • Numerical Technique is employed here. • Convectively heated phenomenon for nanofluid is accounted. Due to variety of noteworthy applications in many fields’ nanotechnology is developing day-by-day, hence research upon this innovative nanofluid become much famous and revolutionized the modern engineering and science. There is another specialty that make this fluid more attractive for researchers is its environmental friendliness. Main objective in this research work is to analyze the impact of oxytactic moment of microorganisms on convectively heated magneto-Carreau fluid capturing random ferro-magnetic nanoparticles. Additionality, bioconvection phenomenon is constructed subjected to viscous dissipation. Similarity","au":["Muhammad Tabrez","Waqar Azeem Khan","Iftikhar Hussain","Mehboob Ali"],"o":"回填","why":["joule heat"],"zt":"含有焦耳热和旋转微organisms现象的铁磁纳米粒子的磁生物对流","zb":"研究含随机铁磁纳米颗粒的磁 Carreau 流体，分析旋游微生物对对流加热流体的影响，利用相似变量将非线性 PDE 转化为 ODE，并采用 bvp4c 数值技术求解。详细阐述了速度场、温度、浓度及生物对流密度分布，并给出了 Nusselt 数、Sherwood 数和微生物密度。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控"},{"id":"10.1016/j.optmat.2025.116989","t":"Synthesis of Zno Nanorods on Tio2 and Zno Inverse Opal Structures Prepared Via Thermal-Atomic Layer Deposition and Hydrothermal Growth for Photocatalytic Applications","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.optmat.2025.116989","s":"Optical Materials","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Industrial pollutants, including synthetic dyes and organic compound, pose serious environmental risks, making efficient remediation methods crucial. In this study, opal templates were fabricated using the Evaporation Induced Confined Area Assembly (EICAA) method, where polystyrene nanospheres (300 nm) were precisely assembled on silicon wafers. Subsequently, ZnO and TiO2 layers were deposited onto the templates using thermal ALD. The polystyrene templates were then removed via calcination at 500°C. Hydrothermal synthesis was employed to grow ZnO nanorods on the prepared structures. Comprehensive characterization was conducted using TG/DTA/DTG, SEM-EDX, XRD, Raman spectroscopy, UV-Vis spectrophotometry, and photoluminescence analysis. The results showed that the samples exhibited a well-ordered, crystalline inverse opal structure with vertically aligned nanorods on their surface. The pho","au":["Lucy Nyambura Karanja","Dániel Karajz","Dóra Hessz","Tamás Igricz","Baradács Eszter Mónika","Pál Petra"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic Layer Deposit"],"zt":"在 TiO2 和 ZnO 逆 opal 结构上通过热原子层沉积和水热生长制备的 ZnO 纳米棒及其光催化应用","zb":"利用 EICAA 方法在硅片上组装 300 nm 聚苯乙烯纳米球作为模板，经热 ALD 沉积 ZnO 和 TiO2 层后 calcination 去除模板，再 hydrothermal 生长 ZnO 纳米棒。结果表明 ZnO 反蛋白石结构的光催化活性优于 TiO2，在 TiO2 反蛋白石上生长 ZnO 纳米棒形成微 p-n 结显著提升了活性，ZnO 纳米棒在 ZnO 反蛋白石上的活性最高。","ob":"材料制备/结构调控；涉及原子层沉积","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.236897","t":"Rapid synthesis of carbon-supported CoS2/CoSe2 heterostructures by magnetic induction heating for efficient hydrogen evolution reaction in acidic media","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.236897","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"spectroscopic measurements. Consistent results are obtained in theoretical studies based on density functional theory calculations. Results from this work highlight the unique potential of heterostructured materials as viable catalysts for electrochemical energy technologies.","au":["Bingzhe Yu","John Tressel","Tianchen Cui","Dingjie Pan","Davida Briana DuBois","Colton Jones"],"o":"回填","why":["induction heating"],"zt":"磁感应加热快速合成碳载CoS2/CoSe2异质结构用于酸性介质中高效的析氢反应","zb":"通过磁感应加热快速合成碳载CoS2/CoSe2异质结构，用于酸性介质中的析氢反应。采用光谱学测量和基于密度泛函理论计算的理论研究，获得一致结果。结果表明异质结构材料在电化学能源技术中具有独特的潜在应用价值。","ob":"析氢反应｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2025.01.065","t":"Toward Joule heating recycling of spent lithium-ion batteries: A rising direct regeneration method","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2025.01.065","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Haoxuan Yu","Meiting Huang","Yifeng Li","Liang Chen","Hui Lv","Liming Yang"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"面向废锂离子电池焦耳加热回收：一种新兴的直接再生方法","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.inoche.2025.114223","t":"From nanoparticle to nanofilm: Atomic layer deposition enabled Pt/carbon cloth electrodes for enhanced hydrogen evolution activity in both acid and alkaline medium","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.inoche.2025.114223","s":"Inorganic Chemistry Communications","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["He Chen","Jin-Tao Chen","Xin Long","Xian-Zhu Fu"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"从纳米颗粒到纳米薄膜：原子层沉积制备的Pt/碳布电极用于增强酸性和碱性介质中的析氢活性","ob":"析氢反应；涉及碳材料、原子层沉积","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cherd.2025.05.035","t":"Exploring induction heating catalysis with nano-indium on silica: From room-temperature to thermal synthesis of 1,3-dioxolane as a new sustainable fertilizer enhancer","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cherd.2025.05.035","s":"Chemical Engineering Research and Design","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Maciej Kapkowski","Tomasz Siudyga","Karina Kocot","Katarzyna Balin","Marcin Fijałkowski","Maciej Zubko"],"o":"回填","why":["induction heating"],"zt":"探索纳米铟在二氧化硅上的感应加热催化：从室温到热合成1,3-二氧杂环己烷作为新型可持续肥料增强剂","ob":"通用催化方法","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.162963","t":"Direct resistive heating of a catalytic fixed-bed reactor for ethanol dehydration","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.162963","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Emre Turan","Robert Dieckmann","Michael Geske","Raoul Naumann d’Alnoncourt","Michael Bender","Johannes Bode"],"o":"回填","why":["resistive heat"],"zt":"直接电阻加热催化固定床反应器用于乙醇脱水","ob":"反应阶段焦耳/电阻供热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115283","t":"Atomic layer deposited zinc promoted copper catalysts for carbon dioxide hydrogenation to methanol: Influence of support","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115283","s":"Catalysis Today","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["ald"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"Copper promoted with zinc is an active catalyst for carbon dioxide hydrogenation to methanol, a reaction relevant to carbon capture and utilization technologies. Previous work showed that inverse zinc-on-copper catalysts on zirconia supports, where zinc(II) is added via atomic layer deposition (ALD), are more active and selective in this reaction than copper-on-zinc catalysts on zirconia. This work continues exploring the inverse zinc-on-copper catalysts by varying the support, comparing zirconia support with alumina, titania and niobia, and with various combinations of the ceria-zirconia-lanthana mixed oxide family. Catalyst characterization was made with elemental analysis, temperature-programmed reduction, temperature-programmed desorption of carbon dioxide, nitrous oxide pulse titration, and transmission electron microscopy. Activity was measured in a fixed-bed flow reactor at 450–55","au":["Aitor Arandia","Jorge A. Velasco","Ahmed Sajid","Jihong Yim","Hammad Shamshad","Hua Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["Atomic layer deposit"],"zt":"原子层沉积锌促进铜催化剂用于CO₂加氢制甲醇：载体影响","zb":"本研究比较了在氧化锆、氧化铝、二氧化钛、五氧化二铌以及铈锆镧混合氧化物载体上，原子层沉积锌（II）乙酰丙酮盐制备的锌在铜上的逆结构催化剂的活性。在450–550 K下测试发现，所有载体上的锌密度约为每平方纳米两个锌，锌的加入显著提高了甲醇产率。","ob":"其他催化反应；涉及原子层沉积｜表征温程（TPR/TPD/TPO 等，不等于反应供热）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apmt.2025.102705","t":"Joule heating and synthesis of transesterification vitrimer and epoxy system","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apmt.2025.102705","s":"Applied Materials Today","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["joule"],"tr":"transferable","sc":18,"ab":"","au":["Smita Shivraj Dasari","Sidney M. Cotton","Lou E. Arrambide","Shegufta T. Upama","Ethan M. Harkin","Sayyam S. Deshpande"],"o":"回填","why":["Joule heat"],"zt":"酯交换热固性树脂与环氧体系的焦耳加热合成","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.seppur.2024.130349","t":"Visible light-induced photocatalytic oxidation of gaseous ammonia on C surface-coated N-TiO2 catalyst: synthesis, properties and mechanism","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.seppur.2024.130349","s":"Separation and Purification Technology","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Fengyu Gao","Jiyue Zhang","Jiaying Jiang","Xiaolong Tang","Yuansong Zhou","Honghong Yi"],"o":"回填","zt":"N-TiO2 催化剂 C 表面涂层可见光诱导气相氨的光催化氧化：合成、性能和机理","ob":"光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jallcom.2025.181186","t":"Influencing Factors and Mechanism of Photocatalytic Degradation of Ammonia-Nitrogen Wastewater by Zno/Sio2/G-C3n4","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jallcom.2025.181186","s":"Journal of Alloys and Compounds","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"uncertain","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xiao Wang","Yaoguo Huang","Jian Zou","Linlin Chen","Ming Wang","Yali Zhang"],"o":"回填","zt":"ZnO/SiO2/G-C3N4 光催化降解氨氮废水的影响因素和机理","ob":"光驱动","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.26599/nre.2025.9120161","t":"Fe foam supported FeVO 4 nanoparticles for electrochemical nitrogen fixation at ambient conditions","u":"https://doi.org/10.26599/nre.2025.9120161","s":"Nano Research Energy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"As global energy demand continues to rise with fossil fuels dwindling at a faster rate, posing energy and environmental concerns, there is a growing interest in exploring alternative, green, and renewable energy sources. Ammonia is a key hydrogen energy carrier and precursor to many value-added products, and the efforts for its generation at commercial scale using greener methods are intensifying to mitigate the reliance on the energy-intensive Haber-Bosch process. The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (e-NRR) is a highly promising way of synthesizing ammonia under energy-efficient, green, and ambient conditions. Despite its attractive potential, the activity and efficiency of conventional eNRR catalysts are still a major concern due to low selectivity and poor ammonia yields. Inspired by the FeFe and FeV cofactors present in nitrogenases, this study reports the synthesis and e","au":["Abdulmalik Aminu","Bilal Masood Pirzada","Shamraiz Hussain Talib","Janah Shaya","Ibrahim Yildiz","Sharmarke Mohamed"],"o":"回填","why":["synthesizing ammonia"],"zt":"Fe泡沫负载的FeVO4纳米颗粒用于环境条件下的电化学氮固定","zb":"Fe泡沫负载的FeVO4纳米颗粒作为电化学氮固定催化剂，在环境条件下表现出优异性能。在0.1 M Na2SO4溶液中，-0.2 VRHE电位下，最高氨产率为22.5 µg·h–1·mg–1，法拉第效率为20.74%。该催化剂在-0.2 VRHE电位下稳定运行24小时。优异性能源于Fe和V之间的协同作用以及FeVO4与Fe泡沫载体之间的耦合相互作用，这些相互作用暴露了丰富的活性位点并促进了电荷转移，从而提高了电化学氮还原反应活性。DFT计算表明表面Fe原子是主要的活性位点。","ob":"电化学氮还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/s1872-2067(25)64705-x","t":"Neighboring effect in PtCuSnCo alloy catalysts for precisely regulating nitrate adsorption and deoxidation to achieve 100% faradaic efficiency in ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/s1872-2067(25)64705-x","s":"Chinese Journal of Catalysis","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yun Ling","Hui Su","Ru-Yu Zhou","Qingyun Feng","Xuan Zheng","Jing Tang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"PtCuSnCo合金催化剂中的邻近效应对硝酸盐吸附和脱氧的精确调控以实现氨合成中的100%法拉第效率","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.surfin.2025.106609","t":"Mg-Fe catalyst prepared by MgFe2O4 spinel oxide as a precursor for the promotion of ammonia decomposition","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.surfin.2025.106609","s":"Surfaces and Interfaces","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Na Luan","Aili Guan","Zhuo Li","Ming Gao","Shuangju Li","Song Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"由 MgFe2O4 纤维氧化物制备的 Mg-Fe 催化剂作为促进氨分解的先驱体","ob":"氨分解制氢；涉及Fe/铁体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.psep.2025.107128","t":"Development and techno-economic analysis of an innovative solar-based ammonia synthesis system","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.psep.2025.107128","s":"Process Safety and Environmental Protection","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zihan Lin","Muhammad Sajid Khan","Saboora Khatoon","Shuiqing Zhou","Weiya Jin","Muhammad Abid"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"开发和工艺经济分析的一种创新太阳能氨合成系统","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.mattod.2025.02.012","t":"Boosting ammonia electrosynthesis via interfacial tandem nitrate reduction enabled by an amorphous@crystalline electrocatalyst","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mattod.2025.02.012","s":"Materials Today","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zeyu Li","Qing Wang","Lixiang Zhong","Chunshuang Yan","Zichen Shi","Yinggang Ou"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"通过界面串联硝酸盐还原增强氨电合成：由非晶态@结晶电催化剂实现","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jprocont.2025.103436","t":"Studying the effect of dynamic operation conditions on green ammonia production synthesis loop","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jprocont.2025.103436","s":"Journal of Process Control","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"The global challenges meeting hydrogen demands due to limited renewable resources urge the need for low-cost imports. Green ammonia, promising for its existing infrastructure, encounters inflexibility challenges in large-scale production with renewables. This study delves into ammonia synthesis loop flexibility amid renewable intermittencies. Utilizing an Aspen Plus® model of 1223 tonnes per day ammonia production capacity, the transient behavior under varied feed flow was investigated with Aspen Dynamics™ simulations. The findings indicated that effective strategies enabled managing a minimum load of 10 % or lower under stoichiometric conditions, constrained by the electrolysis system's lower load. The study also concluded that the ammonia synthesis unit's 20 %/hr feed flow ramp rate is restricted by the thermal cycling of the reactor catalyst; the consequences of fast ramp-up and ramp-","au":["Raj Patel","Amin Soleimani Mehr","Jimena Incer Valverde","Günter Scheffknecht","Jörg Maier","Reihaneh Zohourian"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"研究动态操作条件对绿色氨生产合成循环的影响","zb":"研究对象为绿色氨生产合成循环，关键方法为利用 Aspen Plus® 模型和 Aspen Dynamics™ 模拟研究不同进料流量下的瞬态行为，主要结果为发现有效策略可在化学计量条件下管理最低负荷为 10 % 或更低，但受电解系统低负荷限制；氨合成单元的进料流量变化速率受反应器催化剂热循环限制，快速升降操作参数是主要限制因素。"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.236748","t":"Efficient electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia at low voltage through copper and graphene oxide co-modified nickel foam","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jpowsour.2025.236748","s":"Journal of Power Sources","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xiaohan Huang","Zhengyang Liu","Huayan Yang","Tao Ding","Zehui Zhang","Dongting Yue"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"通过铜和氧化石墨烯共修饰镍泡沫在低电压下高效电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及碳材料｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jhazmat.2025.137553","t":"Paired Electrocatalysis for Simultaneous Anodic Oxidation of Tetracycline and Cathodic Nitrate Reduction to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jhazmat.2025.137553","s":"Journal of Hazardous Materials","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Simultaneous treatment of organic and inorganic pollution and the production of value-added chemicals is still a great challenge. Herein a paired electrocatalytic system using the same CuO/CF as both anode and cathode catalyst for the degradation of tetracycline (TC) in the anodic chamber and the conversion of nitrate (NO3-) into ammonia (NH3) by electrochemical reduction. After in-situ reduction to Cu2O/CuO/CF from CuO/CF, it had stronger adsorption of NO3- and a higher hydrogen energy barrier, enhancing cathodic reduction of NO3- to NH3 with a high selectivity of 99.35 %. Attributed to the generation of singlet oxygen (1O2) and hydroxyl radical (•OH), the anodic oxidation on CuO/CF could completely degrade TC within 40 min with the reaction rate constant (k = 0.253 min-1) that about 16.8 times faster than that on the conventional dimensionally stable anode (DSA). Moreover, this paired ","au":["Chunhong Fu","Huizhong Wu","Jiangli Sun","Ge Song","Minghua Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"配对电催化用于同时阳极氧化四环素和阴极硝酸盐还原为氨","zb":"该研究提出了一种配对电催化系统，使用相同的 CuO/CF 作为阳极和阴极催化剂，在阳极室降解四环素 (TC)，通过电化学还原将硝酸盐 (NO3-) 转换为氨 (NH3)。经过原位还原从 CuO/CF 到 Cu2O/CuO/CF，它对 NO3- 的吸附更强，氢能势垒更高，增强了阴极还原 NO3- 为 NH3，选择性高达 99.35%。由于单线态氧 (1O2) 和羟基自由基 (•OH) 的产生，CuO/CF 上的阳极氧化可以在 40 分钟内完全降解 TC，反应速率常数 (k = 0.253 min-1) 比传统稳定阳极 (DSA) 快约 16.8 倍。此外，与阳极氧化和阴极还原的单系统相比，该配对系统节省了约 58.1% 的能耗。这种配对电催化为复杂废水的处理和增值化学品的生成了新策略。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jechem.2025.01.075","t":"Sustainable ammonia synthesis: Opportunities for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jechem.2025.01.075","s":"Journal of Energy Chemistry","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Haoxuan Jiang","Tianyu Li","Yuting Gao","Jieping Fan","Dingwei Gan","Shuai Yuan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"可持续氨合成：电催化硝酸盐还原的机遇","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2025.117055","t":"Rational design on Cu-based electrochemical catalyst for efficient green ammonia production from nitrate: A review","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.117055","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Karuppiah Veerathangam","Nancy Anna Anasthasiya A","Yunliang Liu","Jingya Yin","Peter Phiri","Yaxi Li"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"基于 Cu 的电化学催化剂的合理设计用于从硝酸盐中高效绿色生产氨：一篇综述","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jece.2025.116708","t":"Co-deposition of CuxFey on nickel foam promotes NH3 desorption to enhance nitrate reduction activity and ammonia selectivity","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jece.2025.116708","s":"Journal of Environmental Chemical Engineering","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Guangyuan Meng","Xinwan Zhang","Wenzhao Fu","Yannan Qiu","Di Yin","Peng Chen"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrate reduction"],"zt":"在镍泡沫上共沉积 CuxFey 促进 NH3 解吸以增强硝酸盐还原活性和氨选择性","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116054","t":"Effect of water impurities on promoted and unpromoted cobalt-catalysts during the ammonia decomposition reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jcat.2025.116054","s":"Journal of Catalysis","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Zahra Almisbaa","Philippe Sautet"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"水杂质对促进和非促进钴催化剂在氨分解反应中的影响","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.isci.2025.112729","t":"Heterogeneous 2D/2D MnO2/MXene catalyst for nitrate-to-ammonia electrochemical reduction and Zn-nitrate battery behavior","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.isci.2025.112729","s":"iScience","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ambient temperature electrochemical ammonia synthesis via nitrate reduction reaction (NO3RR) is a promising alternative to the energy-intensive Haber-Bosch process but lacks effective electrocatalysts for practical applications. In this work, MnO2 2D-nanoflakes are anchored onto 2D-MXene Ti3C2Tx, forming a heterogeneous catalyst for NO3RR with an ammonia yield of 14.06 ± 0.48 mg h−1.mgcat−1 at −1.2 V versus reversible hydrogen electrode (vs. RHE) and a Faradaic efficiency (FE) of 85.23 ± 1.62% at −1.0 vs. RHE, along with good stability over six consecutive cycles, with NH3 FE exceeding 75% at −1.0 V vs. RHE in 0.5 M K2SO4 and 0.1 M KNO3 electrolyte. As a cathode in a Zn-NO3− battery with a polished Zn plate from spent Zn-C batteries as anode, it delivers a power density of 0.323 mW cm−2 and NH3 FE of ∼79.9%. This study highlights a highly effective electrocatalyst for NO3RR and its poten","au":["Thi Kim Cuong Phu","Thanh Ngoc Pham","An-Giang Nguyen","Thi Nhan Tran","Thi Minh-Anh Tran","Ngan Nguyen Le"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"用于硝酸盐到氨电化学还原和锌-硝酸盐电池行为的异质2D/2D MnO2/MXene催化剂","zb":"环境温度下通过硝酸盐还原反应（NO3RR）电化学合成氨是哈伯-博施过程的一种有前景的替代方案，但缺乏有效的电催化剂用于实际应用。在这项工作中，MnO2 2D纳米片锚定在2D-MXene Ti3C2Tx上，形成一种用于NO3RR的异质催化剂，在-1.2 V相对于可逆氢电极（vs. RHE）下氨产率为14.06 ± 0.48 mg h−1.mgcat−1，在-1.0 vs. RHE下法拉第效率（FE）为85.23 ± 1.62%，并具有良好的稳定性，连续六个循环后，在0.5 M K2SO4和0.1 M KNO3电解质中-1.0 V vs. RHE下氨FE超过75%。作为锌-NO3−电池的阴极，使用从废旧锌-碳电池中磨光的锌板作为阳极，它提供功率密度为0.323 mW cm−2和氨FE为∼79.9%。这项研究突出了一种高效的NO3RR电催化剂及其在自供电氨生产中的潜力。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.05.281","t":"Design and development of a novel membrane reactor assembled with a flat-plate hydrogen-permeable membrane and an ammonia decomposition catalyst for producing hydrogen from ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.05.281","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Kaori Omata","Hideo Yoshinaga","Tomonori Nambu"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"设计和开发了一种新型膜反应器，该反应器装配有平板氢渗透膜和氨分解催化剂，用于从氨中生产氢","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.03.170","t":"Hydrogen production from ammonia decomposition over highly active Ni/Al catalyst prepared via plasma-assisted strategy","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ijhydene.2025.03.170","s":"International Journal of Hydrogen Energy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Weili Zhou","Wenshuo Zhang","Yun Shan","Bingzhi Liu","Kai Li","Jie Ren"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"通过等离子体辅助策略制备的高活性Ni/Al催化剂上氨分解制氢","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.envres.2025.121123","t":"Advances in electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia over Cu-based catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.envres.2025.121123","s":"Environmental Research","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Ammonia (NH₃) is a critical basic material for both the agricultural and pharmaceutical industries. Traditionally, NH₃ synthesis has relied on the Haber-Bosch process, which is characterized by high greenhouse gas emissions and stringent reaction conditions. As a more sustainable and cost-effective alternative, electrocatalytic NH₃ synthesis has gained increasing attention. Nitrate (NO₃⁻), a common pollutant in water and soil, is considered a promising nitrogen source for NH₃ production due to its high solubility and relatively low N=O bond dissociation energy. This makes it particularly suitable for electrocatalytic nitrate reduction to ammonia (NRA), a process with significant potential for addressing nitrate pollution while contributing to NH₃ production. However, challenges such as slow reaction kinetics and poor product selectivity persist in the NRA process. To overcome these chall","au":["Zhibin Zhang","Kailun Yu","Hui Wang","Zhaoyong Bian"],"o":"回填","why":["NH₃ synthesis"],"zt":"基于铜催化剂的电催化硝酸盐还原为氨的进展","zb":"氨（NH3）是农业和制药行业的关键基础材料。传统上，氨的合成依赖于哈伯-博施过程，该过程的特点是温室气体排放高且反应条件严格。作为一种更可持续和经济的替代方案，电催化氨合成越来越受到关注。硝酸盐（NO3-）是水和土壤中的常见污染物，由于其高溶解度和相对较低的N=O键解离能，被认为是氨生产的有希望的氮源。这使得它特别适合于电催化硝酸盐还原为氨（NRA）的过程，该过程在解决硝酸盐污染的同时有助于氨的生产。然而，在NRA过程中，反应动力学慢和产物选择性差等挑战仍然存在。为了克服这些挑战，催化剂的选择和优化对于提高NRA性能至关重要。在各种催化剂中，铜基（Cu）催化剂由于其独特的电子结构和出色的催化性能而受到广泛关注。本综述全面分析了铜基催化剂在NRA中的应用和反应机理，以及该领域使用的测试系统和评估指标。此外，它还强调了当前挑战并概述了未来的研究方向，以支持铜基材料在NRA应用中的持续发展。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.enconman.2025.119802","t":"Sparks to synthesis: A roadmap to feasible ammonia production via plasma catalysis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.enconman.2025.119802","s":"Energy Conversion and Management","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Lance Kosca","Mozah Almatrooshi","Kaisar Ahmad","Swati Singh","Marko Gacesa","Kyriaki Polychronopoulou"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"从火花到合成：一条可行的通过等离子体催化生产氨气的路线","ob":"等离子体制氨｜等离子体驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.colsurfa.2025.136591","t":"Unlocking the catalytic performance of rare earth single atom catalysts for electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.colsurfa.2025.136591","s":"Colloids and Surfaces A: Physicochemical and Engineering Aspects","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Yidi Hu","Ruochen Zhu","Xinyuan Yang","Haoyu Wang","Changzheng Lv","Xiaolong Zhou"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrogen reduction reaction"],"zt":"解锁稀土单原子催化剂在电化学氮还原反应中的催化性能","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cjsc.2025.100599","t":"Single-atom catalysts for electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction to ammonia: A review","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cjsc.2025.100599","s":"Chinese Journal of Structural Chemistry","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Qiaorui Wang","Dingyun Liang","Zhongwen Zhang","Yalan Yang","Yunran Zhang","Yirong Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["electrocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"用于电催化氮还原为氨的单原子催化剂：综述","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.checat.2025.101337","t":"Oxygen-vacancy-mediated photocatalytic activity of antimony molybdenum oxide toward green ammonia synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.checat.2025.101337","s":"Chem Catalysis","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Botong Liu","Ling Huang","Terence Musho","Chih-Jung Chen","Chung-Li Dong","Chaoyun Tang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"氧空位介导的锑钼氧化物对绿色氨合成的光催化活性","ob":"光驱动","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.ceramint.2025.02.063","t":"Efficient ammonia synthesis in perovskite cathode-supported protonic ceramic electrochemical cell with dendritic porous structure","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ceramint.2025.02.063","s":"Ceramics International","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Haochen Dang","Enhua Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"具有枝状多孔结构的钙钛矿阴极支撑质子陶瓷电化学电池中高效的氨合成","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.162736","t":"Hydrogen radical-mediated efficient electrocatalytic N2 reduction by bimetallic sulfides","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.162736","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Nana Li","Jing Zhang","Zhiqiang Qiao","Di Gu","Debin Ji","Zhida Li"],"o":"回填","why":["N2 reduction"],"zt":"氢自由基介导的双金属硫化物高效电催化 N2 还原","ob":"电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115254","t":"Pulsed laser ablation-synthesized FePt nanoparticles have enhanced catalytic nitrite reduction activity","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cattod.2025.115254","s":"Catalysis Today","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Kiheon Hong","Welman C. Elias","Kimberly N. Heck","Tanguy Terlier","Dimpel Dimpel","Wei Qian"],"o":"回填","why":["nitrite reduction"],"zt":"脉冲激光烧蚀合成的 FePt 纳米颗粒具有增强的催化亚硝酸还原活性","ob":"材料制备/结构调控","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.biombioe.2025.107792","t":"Energy and exergy assessment of anaerobic digestion process for ammonia synthesis: Toward a sustainable water-energy-food nexus","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.biombioe.2025.107792","s":"Biomass and Bioenergy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Mohammadamin Jalilvand","M. Soltani","Morteza Hosseinpour","Jatin Nathwani","Ann Fitz-Gerald"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"厌氧消化过程用于氨合成的能量和㶲评估：迈向可持续的水-能源-食物纽带","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125104","t":"Modulating dynamic atomic hydrogen generation and utilization for selective electrocatalytic ammonia recovery from low-concentration nitrate-containing wastewater","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125104","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Herein, a copper-doped nickel phosphide (Cu x Ni 2-x P) electrode with a tailored metal d-band center was designed to boost ammonia (NH 3 ) selectivity during electrocatalytic nitrate (NO 3 − ) reduction (NO 3 RR) by modulating atomic hydrogen (H*) behavior. The Cu doping accelerated both the Volmer step of water splitting to form H* and the H* -mediated hydrogenation steps for NH 3 production, addressing the mismatch between H* supply and utilization. Consequently, the Cu x Ni 2-x P electrode achieved 100 % NO 3 − conversion efficiency and 99.2 % NH 3 selectivity at a low NO 3 − concentration of 50 mg L −1 , outperforming Ni 2 P and Cu counterparts. The crucial role of H* in the performance enhancement was elucidated via in-situ characterizations and density functional theory (DFT) calculations . Furthermore, an integrated device combining NO 3 RR, organic pollutant degradation and NH 3","au":["Chao Wang","Jinling Fan","Meng Sun","Linji Xu","Pan Xia","Qiang He"],"o":"回填","why":["electrocatalytic ammonia"],"zt":"调节动态原子氢生成和利用用于从低浓度含硝酸盐废水中选择性电催化氨回收","zb":"设计了一种铜掺杂的镍磷化物（Cu x Ni 2-x P）电极，通过调节原子氢（H*）行为来提高氨（NH 3 ）选择性，在电催化硝酸盐（NO 3 − ）还原（NO 3 RR）过程中。Cu 掺杂加速了水分解的 Volmer 步骤形成 H* 和 H* -介导的氢化步骤用于 NH 3 生成，解决了 H* 供应和利用之间的不匹配。Cu x Ni 2-x P 电极在低 NO 3 − 浓度 50 mg L −1 时实现了 100 % NO 3 − 转化效率和 99.2 % NH 3 选择性，优于 Ni 2 P 和 Cu 对应物。通过原位表征和密度泛函理论（DFT）计算阐明了 H* 在性能增强中的关键作用。此外，构建了一个结合 NO 3 RR、有机污染物降解和 NH 3 回收的集成装置，展示了其在实际废水处理中的可扩展性。","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125034","t":"Ru single atom modified DUT-67(Zr) with unsaturated Zr for high-efficiency photocatalytic nitrogen reduction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125034","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jinjing Qiu","Qi Chen","Cheng Liu","Yueling Chen","Jionghua Wu","Kaiqiang Jing"],"o":"回填","why":["photocatalytic nitrogen reduction"],"zt":"Ru 单原子修饰的 DUT-67(Zr)（不饱和 Zr）用于高效光催化氮还原","ob":"涉及Ru/钌体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125028","t":"Fe-triggered Mn-mullite oxides for efficient low-temperature reduction of nitrogen oxides: Insights into the structure-activity relationship","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125028","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-29T08:07:55Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Jingyi Zhu","Chao Jin","Yongjian Duan","Linhua Zhu","Junhao Liu","Kai Cheng"],"o":"回填","why":["reduction of nitrogen"],"zt":"Fe 触发 Mn-刚玉氧化物用于高效的低温氮氧化物还原：结构-活性关系研究","ob":"涉及Fe/铁体系","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125027","t":"Bimetallic Phthalocyanine Catalyst for Ammonia Electrosynthesis from Nitrate Reduction Across All Ph Ranges","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125027","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Junyuan Feng","Qikun Hu","Xian Yue","Qian Chen","Changqin Gao","Jun Gu"],"o":"回填","why":["Nitrate Reduction"],"zt":"双金属酞菁催化剂用于跨越所有 pH 范围从硝酸根还原电合成氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1,"pp":"SSRN"},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125020","t":"Enhancing metal-support interactions in CeAlOx/Co inverse catalyst for significantly boosting ammonia decomposition reaction","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2025.125020","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xing-Chi Li","Tao-Tao Huang","Yang Hu","Xin Li","Yi-Fei Liu","Hao Dong"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia decomposition"],"zt":"增强 CeAlOx/Co 逆催化剂中的金属-载体相互作用以显著提高氨分解反应","ob":"氨分解制氢","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.apcatb.2024.125013","t":"Spatial confinement of nitrogen through carboxyl-induced hydrogen bond networks in covalent organic frameworks for efficient overall ammonia photosynthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.apcatb.2024.125013","s":"Applied Catalysis B: Environment and Energy","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"","au":["Xiaolong Zhang","Ying Liu","Shufan Feng","Xixin Gu","Min Zhou","Haifeng Wang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia photosynthesis"],"zt":"通过羧基诱导的氢键网络在共价有机框架中对氮进行空间限域用于高效的总体氨光合作用","bt":1},{"id":"10.1002/adsu.202500211","t":"Unveiling pH‐Dependent Mechanistic Shifts in Cu 2 O‐Catalyzed Nitrate Electroreduction for Selective Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adsu.202500211","s":"Advanced Sustainable Systems","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electrocatalytic nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) offers a sustainable route for ammonia synthesis, yet its practical implementation requires catalysts adaptable to pH fluctuations inherent in industrial wastewater systems. Herein, Cu 2 O nanocubes as a model catalyst is synthesized and decoupled the pH‐dependent reaction mechanisms with systematic experimental investigations. In acid electrolytes, the catalyst exhibited 93.3% faradaic efficiency for NH 3 with a yield rate of 34.6 mg h −1 mg cat −1 at −0.7 V versus. RHE. In contrast, in alkaline and neutral electrolytes, NH 3 synthesis is impeded by the formation of NO 2 ‐ which served as the predominant by‐product. Through operando infrared spectroscopy analysis, proton availability as the pivotal regulator is identified: Acidic media facilitates the further conversion of * NO 2 intermediates into NH 3 via the NOH pathw","au":["Zizi Wang","Fengchen Zhou","Binxin Lv","Jiayue Yu","Junjun Zhang","Yifan Zhang"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"揭示 Cu 2 O 催化的硝酸根电还原中 pH 依赖的机理转变用于选择性氨合成","zb":"研究 Cu 2 O 纳米立方体作为模型催化剂，通过系统实验研究将 pH 依赖的反应机理与酸电解质中 93.3% 的氨法拉第效率 (产率 34.6 mg h⁻¹ mg cat −1，在 -0.7 V vs. RHE 下) 对比，在碱性和中性电解质中，氨合成受 NO 2⁻ 形成阻碍。原位红外光谱分析表明质子可用性是关键调节器：酸性介质通过 NOH 途径促进 NO 2 中间体的进一步转化成 NH 3，而中性/碱性条件下 H⁺ 缺乏的环境将反应通量通过 NHO 途径转移。机理阐明表明质子浓度是指导硝酸根到氨转化效率的关键参数。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adsu.202500112","t":"Co(II)‐Imidazolate‐Based Metal–Organic Frameworks as Efficient Bifunctional Electrocatalysts for Water Oxidation and Electroreduction of Nitrogen to Ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adsu.202500112","s":"Advanced Sustainable Systems","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract The electrochemical nitrogen reduction reaction (ENRR), when coupled with the oxygen evolution reaction (OER), presents a sustainable, safe, and energy‐efficient alternative to the traditional Haber–Bosch process for ammonia synthesis. In this work, the rational design, synthesis, and electrochemical evaluation of two cobalt (II)‐based metal–organic frameworks (MOFs) incorporating 2‐methylimidazole (2‐MeIm) and benzimidazole (BIm) as organic linkers is reported. Comprehensive voltammetric and in situ spectroelectrochemical studies confirm that Co(2‐MeIm) and Co(BIm) MOFs exhibit excellent electrochemical stability and catalytic activity toward ENRR and OER. Notably, Co(BIm) MOF achieves an impressive ammonia production rate of 260 µg h⁻¹ mg⁻¹ with a Faradaic efficiency of 35.42%, significantly outperforming Co(2‐MeIm) MOF (5.0 µg h⁻¹ mg⁻¹ and 15.0%, respectively). Furthermore, C","au":["Shazia Nabi","Murtaza Manzoor Bhat","Aadil Hamid","Aamir Y. Bhat","Aejaz Ul Bashir","Qounsar Jan"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia synthesis"],"zt":"基于 Co(II)-咪唑olate 的金属-有机框架作为高效的二元电催化剂用于水氧化和氮气电还原合成氨","zb":"研究合成并评估了两种基于 Co(II) 的金属-有机框架 (MOFs)，使用 2-甲基咪唑 (2-MeIm) 和苯并咪唑 (BIm) 作为有机连接体，用于电化学氮还原反应 (ENRR) 和析氧反应 (OER)。Co(BIm) MOF 实现了 260 µg h⁻¹ mg⁻¹ 的氨产率，法拉第效率为 35.42%，显著优于 Co(2-MeIm) MOF (5.0 µg h⁻¹ mg⁻¹ 和 15.0%)。Co(BIm) MOF 表现出优异的 OER 性能，Tafel 斜率为 50.1 mV dec⁻¹，在 10 mA cm⁻² 下过电位为 290 mV。这些 ENRR 和 OER 指标在 MOF 基电催化剂中属于最高报道值，突出了定制配体环境在增强双功能电催化性能方面的潜力。","ob":"电化学氮还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1002/adfm.202507512","t":"A High‐Entropy Engineering on Layered Double Hydroxide Electrocatalyst with Electronic Structure Reconstruction for Ammonia Synthesis","u":"https://doi.org/10.1002/adfm.202507512","s":"Advanced Functional Materials","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":9,"ab":"Abstract High‐entropy electrocatalysts have garnered an increasing attention in electrocatalytic applications due to their outstanding redox reaction capabilities, as well as their selective and stable properties. The deliberate design of high‐entropy materials with high metallic vacancy concentrations and intrinsic strain features with an induced localized empty electronic state and charge redistribution at the bandgap level. A Al/Zn‐etched high‐entropy FeCoNiAlZnCu layered double hydroxide achieves a maximum ammonia Faradaic efficiency of 98.57% at −0.5 V with a production rate of 40.34 mg h −1 cm −2 for the nitrate reduction reaction. Furthermore, it exhibits a favorable oxygen evolution activity with an overpotential of 300 mV at 10 mA cm −2 and a Tafel slope of 92.5 mV dec −1 . Combined with advanced spectroscopic techniques, it reveals that the local metallic vacancy defects can mo","au":["Xuan‐Wen Gao","Si‐yao Li","Tian‐zhen Ren","Ran Wei","Xue Wang","Qin‐Fen Gu"],"o":"回填","why":["Ammonia Synthesis"],"zt":"在具有电子结构重构的层状双氢氧化物电催化剂上进行的熵工程用于氨合成","zb":"研究对象为 Al/Zn-刻蚀的高熵 FeCoNiAlZnCu 层状双氢氧化物电催化剂，用于硝酸根还原反应，在 -0.5 V 下实现 98.57% 的氨法拉第效率，产率为 40.34 mg h⁻¹ cm⁻²，并表现出良好的析氧活性，在 10 mA cm⁻² 下过电位为 300 mV，Tafel 斜率为 92.5 mV dec⁻¹。结合光谱技术揭示局部金属空位缺陷通过刺激电子积累和创造不饱和配位来调节催化活性位点，内部应变和电子重排的协同作用增强了固有催化活性位点，降低了吸收能垒，提高了电子转移动力学，并稳定了固有催化结构。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.mtsust.2025.101104","t":"Multi-site activation in metal-doped CuPd alloy catalysts enhances nitrate electroreduction to ammonia","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.mtsust.2025.101104","s":"Materials Today Sustainability","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"The electrochemical nitrate reduction reaction (NO 3 RR) represents an environmentally friendly pathway for ammonia production and nitrate purification while the development of efficient NO 3 RR catalysts is crucial to achieve a high performance. In this study, a series of transition metal-doped CuPd alloy (TM-CuPd, TM = Sc, Ti, V, Cr, Mn, Fe, Co, Ni) were explored as NO 3 RR catalysts through density functional theory calculation. Multi-site active center was designed to explore the structure-performance relation on TM-CuPd catalysts for NO 3 RR. Notably, Mn–CuPd was proposed to provide a unique combination of high activation ability for NO 3 − and robust protonation ability for intermediates, leading to excellent catalytic performance with the reaction free energy change of 0.14 eV for the potential limiting step of Mn–CuPd in the NO 3 RR. In essence, the excellent activity of Mn–CuPd ","au":["Chen Zhao","Tong-Hui Wang","Zhi Wen Chen","Zi Wen","Qing Jiang"],"o":"回填","why":["ammonia production"],"zt":"金属掺杂 CuPd 合金催化剂中的多位点活化增强硝酸盐电还原为氨","zb":"研究对象为过渡金属掺杂 CuPd 合金（TM-CuPd, TM = Sc, Ti, V, Cr, Mn, Fe, Co, Ni）作为硝酸盐电还原反应（NO 3 RR）催化剂，关键方法为密度泛函理论计算，主要结果为 Mn–CuPd 因其独特的 NO 3 − 高活化能力和中间体强质子化能力而表现出优异催化性能，反应自由能变化为 0.14 eV，其活性源于多位点活性中心上中间体的灵活吸附行为优化了反应路径。","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原；涉及Fe/铁体系｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热"},{"id":"10.1016/j.jwpe.2025.107920","t":"Enhanced electrodialysis by electric double-layer capacitors to minimize membrane use in digestate ammonia recovery: mechanisms and effects","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jwpe.2025.107920","s":"Journal of Water Process Engineering","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Qin-Hua Xu","Yaofeng Cai","Jiajie Li","Minglin Zhou","Yanbin Xu"],"o":"回填","zt":"通过电双层电容器增强电渗析以最小化消化液氨回收中膜的使用：机理和效果","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.jelechem.2025.119110","t":"Electrocatalytic reduction of nitrate into ammonia by bimetallic copper‑nickel catalysts","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jelechem.2025.119110","s":"Journal of Electroanalytical Chemistry","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Qi Wang","Yi Shen"],"o":"回填","zt":"双金属铜-镍催化剂电催化硝酸盐还原为氨","ob":"电化学硝酸盐还原｜电化学驱动，不等于床层焦耳热","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cplett.2025.142059","t":"Facile synthesis of MOFs derived TiO2/ZnO porous composite materials for enhanced ammonia sensing properties at room temperature","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cplett.2025.142059","s":"Chemical Physics Letters","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["E. Namratha","M.S. Surendra Babu","A. Jagan Mohan Reddy"],"o":"回填","zt":"易于合成的 MOFs 衍生 TiO2/ZnO 多孔复合材料用于增强室温氨传感性能","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1},{"id":"10.1016/j.cej.2025.163261","t":"Superior ammonia nitrogen adsorption capacity and reusability biochar microsphere applied in live fish transportation","u":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cej.2025.163261","s":"Chemical Engineering Journal","d":"2025-06","f":"2026-10-28T22:02:07Z","tp":["nh3"],"tr":"background","sc":6,"ab":"","au":["Ling Peng","Tao Yin","Zhiyong Song","Shanbai Xiong","Ru Liu","Juan You"],"o":"回填","zt":"用于活鱼运输的具有优异氨氮吸附能力和可重复使用的生物炭微球","ob":"氨相关分离/检测/资源系统（非制氨反应证据）","bt":1}]);
